i`) |","table":"table-0"},"13":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-11","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言   | 生成什么                                                       |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `js` | `src/lib.rs` + `plugin.js` + `fuyubot_plugin.js`(+`.d.ts`) |","table":"table-0"},"14":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-12","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"生成的 Rust 插件默认写 `fuyubot-plugin-api = \"0.1.1\"`（crates.io）。想对着 SDK 源码开发就设\n`FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 SDK 仓库里放着 crate 的目录（`crates/`），生成器会改写成 `path = …`；\n没设且本地找不到源码时只写版本号。"},"15":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-13","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#codegen","content":"刷新某门语言的 ABI 绑定文件到 `<dir>`：C / C++ 是 `fuyubot_plugin.h`，Python 是\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` + `.pyi`，JS 是 `fuyubot_plugin.js` + `.d.ts`。**会覆盖同名文件**。\n所有语言都来自同一份权威源（`fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER` 与 `fuyubot-sdk-script` 里的桥），\n不是手抄的第二份。`--lang rust` 没有可生成的绑定，命令会说明。"},"16":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-14","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#check","content":"**静态**读 PE / ELF / Mach-O 的导出表（用 `object`，**绝不 dlopen**——加载会在宿主进程里跑插件的\n初始化代码，那已经算「运行」了）。非零退出码 = 宿主会拒绝加载（缺 `plugin_init`，或根本不是动态库）。"},"17":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-15","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#check","content":"`check` 静态看不到 `PluginHandle.abi_version`——版本是 `plugin_init` 的**返回值**，不是静态符号。\n它只会如实报「宿主是 vN，插件的版本只能运行时判定」，**别把它当兼容性结论**。"},"18":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-16","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method--td-types","content":"`td-methods` / `td-method` / `td-types` 吃的都是**编译期**烤进二进制的真 `td_api.tl` 元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`），不读文件、不联网。`--filter` 是子串匹配、忽略大小写；构造器不能当方法调，\n`td-method` 会明确拒绝。"},"19":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-17","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method--td-types","content":"`td-types` 给 `on` / `invoke` 生成精确类型：写到 `--out <目录>` 下的 `td_api.d.ts`（**覆盖同名文件**，\n默认当前目录）。只有 JS / TS 插件用得上它。"},"20":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-18","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method--td-types","content":"TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的：所有发送都是 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`，\n`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` 之类在 TDLib 里不存在。写请求前先用 `td-method` 核一遍。"},"21":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-19","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"各语言怎么写：插件总览"},"22":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"装进插件目录：调试与安装"},"23":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-21","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"环境变量（`FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH`）：环境变量"},"24":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 命令参考","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot"},"25":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-0","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","content":"运行时 CLI：init / run / status / stop / config / plugin"},"26":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-1","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"`init`"},"27":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-2","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run`"},"28":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-3","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"`login`"},"29":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-4","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"`logout`"},"30":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-5","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` / `stop`"},"31":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-6","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`config`"},"32":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-7","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`plugin`"},"33":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-8","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"相关页面"},"34":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-9","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","content":"跑框架的那个 CLI。它就是运行时包里的 `fuyubot(.exe)`（从源码跑时是 `target/{debug,release}/fuyubot`）。"},"35":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-10","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数      | 默认  | 说明                                              |\n| ------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `--dir` | `.` | 项目目录，生成 `<dir>/fuyubot.toml` 与 `<dir>/plugins/` |","table":"table-0"},"36":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-11","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数       | 默认        | 说明             |\n| -------- | --------- | -------------- |\n| `--name` | `fuyubot` | 只影响配置里的 `name` |","table":"table-0"},"37":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-12","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数         | 默认  | 说明                                          |\n| ---------- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `--api-id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（不是秘密，可以写进配置）；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"38":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-13","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"`init` **只写 `api_id`**：`api_hash` 这个命令连参数都不收（init 阶段手上不该有它）——`run` 首次会问，问完写回配置。\n重复 `init` 会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）。"},"39":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-14","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数         | 作用                                              |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml`（缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份） |","table":"table-1"},"40":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-15","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir` | 覆盖 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"41":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-16","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                                                                                                             |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 覆盖配置里的 `api_id`（**不是**秘密，可以写在命令行 / 脚本里）。优先级：`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 `[telegram].api_id` → 交互提问。`api_hash` 没有对应参数（只走 `TG_API_HASH` 或交互输入） |","table":"table-1"},"42":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-17","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"43":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-18","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                        |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 接 TDLib 但不走登录流程（已有 session 照样能用；CI / 容器用） |","table":"table-1"},"44":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-19","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                                                       |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--background` | 派生无终端的子进程，stdout/stderr 进 `logs/fuyubot.log`，父进程等状态发布后返回 |","table":"table-1"},"45":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 把一批更新 JSON 灌进管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号** |","table":"table-1"},"46":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-21","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                   | 作用                                      |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后等插件的静默窗口；不填按插件形态自选（脚本插件 2000，原生 150） |","table":"table-1"},"47":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-22","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run` 不带 `--replay` 的顺序：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → attach TDLib → 问/读凭据 → **加载全部插件** →\n发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 才开始分发。\n**登录这一步没有真账号端到端验过**，要立刻验插件就用 `--replay`——想单独把登录走完（不起框架）用 `login`。"},"48":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-23","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"后台运行**没有 stdin**：没有 session 又没有 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败并把日志尾巴打出来——\n先用前台登录一次（session 落在 `data/`）。"},"49":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-24","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"**只登录，不起框架**：建 TDLib 客户端 → 走完授权 → 打印账户 → 退出。**不加载插件、不开接收循环**。\nsession 落在 `data/`，之后 `fuyubot run`（含 `--background`）起来就直接进 `Ready`——后台跑没有 stdin、\n登录问不了，先前台 `login` 一次正是给这条路准备的。"},"50":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-25","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"| 参数         | 作用                                    |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `--config` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml`（缺文件时同样会自动生成一份） |","table":"table-2"},"51":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-26","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                               |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 与 `run` 的 `--api-id` 同义、同优先级（`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 提问） |","table":"table-2"},"52":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-27","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"凭据解析、授权状态机、账户打印全部复用 `run` 的那套，两条路不会漂移。两条额外限制："},"53":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-28","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"**实例在跑时拒绝**：TDLib 的 sqlite + binlog 同一时刻只能一个进程打开，`login` 再开一次会把跑着的实例拆坏。"},"54":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-29","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"**TDLib 没就绪就报错退出**，告诉你缺什么（`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` / exe 同级 tdjson / `[tdlib].path`）。"},"55":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-30","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"清掉本地 TDLib 会话目录（= `[telegram].data_dir`，默认 `<项目根>/data`，里面是数据库与 binlog）＝ 退出登录，\n下次要重新登录。**默认只打印将要删除什么**，加 `--yes` 才真删。"},"56":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-31","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"它**只清本地**：不发服务端的 `logOut`（Telegram 那边的会话还在，只是本机这份没了）。"},"57":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-32","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 参数      | 作用                  |\n| ------- | ------------------- |\n| `--yes` | 真的删除。不加就是预览，一个文件都不动 |","table":"table-3"},"58":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-33","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"三道守卫与 `--yes` 无关，命中就拒绝："},"59":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-34","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 守卫   | 行为                               |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- |\n| 实例在跑 | 拒绝（预览前、真删前各挡一次）：运行中动会话目录会拆坏它的数据库 |","table":"table-4"},"60":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-35","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 守卫       | 行为                                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 目录不在项目根内 | 放行但打醒目警告：`data_dir` 指到项目外了，确认过再加 `--yes` |","table":"table-4"},"61":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-36","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 守卫                | 行为                                            |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 目录里没有 `td.binlog` | 拒绝：那多半不是 TDLib 的数据目录（`data_dir` 指错了），要删请自己手工删 |","table":"table-4"},"62":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-37","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` 只读 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/`，三态：运行中 / 启动中 / 没有运行中的实例（顺带报「上次」的 pid）。\n`stop` 是**优雅**的：写 `.fuyubot/stop` 请实例自己收摊（停接收循环 → 卸载插件 → 停内核 → 放锁），\n8 秒不理会才硬杀。"},"63":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-38","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"打印**生效值**：默认值填好之后每一项到底是什么，外加「向上找到的那份 `fuyubot.toml`」。\n不加载插件、不接 TDLib、不建任何东西。"},"64":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-39","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"文件不存在时第一行会写「（不存在，下面全是默认值）」——`run` 就是这样起的，不骗人。"},"65":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-40","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`account_type` 写错**不会**静默当 bot：那一行直接是 `⚠️ [telegram].account_type = \"robot\" 认不出来，只能写 \"bot\" 或 \"user\"`。"},"66":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-41","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"每个 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 段各占一行（插件名是点分的，所以显示成 `[plugin.fuyubot.manage]`）；没有插件段时写「无（没有 `[plugin.*]` 段）」。"},"67":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-42","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"没有 `get` / `set` / `path`：改配置用编辑器更直接，路径 `status` 第一行已经打了。**插件**读写配置走 ABI 的 `get_config` / `set_config`（见插件 ABI），不是这个子命令。"},"68":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-43","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                     | 作用                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 列出插件；脚本插件会**展平到每个脚本** |","table":"table-5"},"69":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-44","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                                | 作用                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <文件或目录> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 装一个插件：传**目录**是脚本插件，传**文件**是原生插件 |","table":"table-5"},"70":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-45","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                               | 作用                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <名字> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 卸载：脚本插件按**目录名**，原生插件按动态库名 |","table":"table-5"},"71":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-46","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**脚本插件**（推荐，见 脚本插件）：传的是**整个目录**\n（里面有 `pyproject.toml` / `package.json` 身份段），装到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n目标已存在会报错，要覆盖先 `uninstall` 再 `install`。"},"72":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-47","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**原生插件**：传编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`，或**工程目录**。传目录时按\n`<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 → **沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`\n这个顺序找产物（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档就是给 workspace 成员准备的\n（`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 根本不存在），\n所以那种情况**直接传工程目录就行**，没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数。产物连同旁边 / 工程根的\n`.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 同伴脚本一起拷进插件目录。"},"73":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-48","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`list` 会**真的加载一次**动态库才知道名字，但**只发现不启动**脚本——不装依赖、\n不起进程，随时可以跑。脚本的名字取自 manifest（`name` 字段），路径是入口文件。"},"74":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-49","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`uninstall` 对**跑着的实例也安全**：文件删掉后目录 watch 会自动卸载对应脚本，\n不需要先 `stop`。"},"75":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-50","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"脚本插件上手：脚本插件"},"76":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-51","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"配置字段：配置文件"},"77":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-52","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"实例与后台运行：运行与实例管理"},"78":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-53","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"回放的输出与等待窗口：离线回放"},"79":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI 总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli"},"80":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"两个 CLI 的分工、共同约定与命令速查"},"81":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"共同约定"},"82":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"命令速查"},"83":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"fuyubot 有两个命令行程序，职责严格分离，**都不编译、不打包插件**——编译归插件作者自己的工具链\n（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）。"},"84":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI       | 干什么                                                                               | 二进制             |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架：`init` / `run` / `login` / `logout` / `status` / `stop` / `config` / `plugin` | `fuyubot(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"85":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI           | 干什么                                | 二进制                 |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件：脚手架 / 生成绑定 / 查 TDLib 方法 / 静态检查 | `fuyubot-sdk(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"86":{"id":"/docs/cli-6","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`fuyubot` 在运行时仓库的包里（旁边带着 `tdjson` 和内置插件目录 `plugins/`），`fuyubot-sdk` 在\nFuyuBot-SDK 的\n`fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip` 里（不需要 `tdjson`）。从源码跑的等价写法是把子命令接在 `--` 之后："},"87":{"id":"/docs/cli-7","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项               | 约定                                                                   |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config <文件>` | 默认 `fuyubot.toml`；项目根 = 配置文件所在目录，`plugins/`、`data/`、`.fuyubot/` 都相对它 |","table":"table-1"},"88":{"id":"/docs/cli-8","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项                   | 约定                     |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"89":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                             |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 退出码 | `0` 成功；非零是失败（`fuyubot-sdk check` 非零 = 宿主会拒绝加载） |","table":"table-1"},"90":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                                                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 凭据  | **只走环境变量或交互式输入**，任何命令都不把它们写进文件（`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` / `TG_BOT_TOKEN`） |","table":"table-1"},"91":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项    | 约定                                             |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 输出语言 | 中文；`status` / `stop` 是给人看的，不要拿去解析（没有 `--json`） |","table":"table-1"},"92":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot/\" />"},"93":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot-sdk 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk/\" />"},"94":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"page","content":"架构与数据流","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture"},"95":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"一个宿主进程 + N 个动态库插件，以及它们之间的三段数据流"},"96":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"crate 依赖方向"},"97":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"启动顺序：先 attach TDLib，再 load 插件"},"98":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"主链路"},"99":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"注册作用域与卸载"},"100":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖与激活顺序"},"101":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"两种插件形态"},"102":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"四大机制与内核"},"103":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"绑定层与运行时（`fuyubot-tdlib-sys` / `fuyubot-tdlib`）"},"104":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"`td_api.tl` 转成了什么（**只在编译期**）"},"105":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"关键类型对照"},"106":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"结论先说：**一个宿主进程 + N 个动态库插件（cdylib）**。插件不认识 Rust，只认识 `HostApiVTable`；\n宿主是**唯一**实现这张表的 crate（`fuyubot-loader`）。脚本插件（Python / JS / TS）不改变这个结构\n——目录形态由两个中间插件（`fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`）托管，旧的胶水形态\n则把解释器子进程藏在自己的 cdylib 里。"},"107":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"本文只讲**结构与数据流**；构建、发布与排错见 开发文档。"},"108":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"箭头指向「依赖的那一边」（`A --> B` = A 依赖 B）："},"109":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                | 允许吗 |\n| -------------------------------- | --- |\n| `fuyubot-core` → `fuyubot-tdlib` | 禁止  |","table":"table-0"},"110":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                              | 允许吗 |\n| ------------------------------ | --- |\n| `fuyubot-abi` → `fuyubot-core` | 禁止  |","table":"table-0"},"111":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                | 允许吗       |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | --------- |\n| `event` / `service` / `tool` / `middleware` 互相依赖 | 禁止（彼此不依赖） |","table":"table-0"},"112":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                   | 允许吗       |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` → 任何 fuyu crate | 禁止（它是最底层） |","table":"table-0"},"113":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                  | 允许吗         |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `fuyubot-loader` → 四个机制 + `tdlib` + `abi` + `core` | 允许（**只有它**） |","table":"table-0"},"114":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"组合只发生在两处：`HostRuntime::new`（把四个机制 `install` 进 `Context`）与 `HostRuntime` 里的\n20 个 `unsafe extern \"C\"` 桥（VTable 的 20 个函数指针各对应一个）。四个机制 crate 绝不彼此调用。"},"115":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"启动顺序：attach TDLib 必须在 load 插件之前"},"116":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"五步线性流程：建内核 → 建 loader（装四个机制）→ attach TDLib → dlopen 插件 → 起分发循环。第三步是关键顺序点，做晚了插件发请求就会走「没接 TDLib」分支。"},"117":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"1"},"118":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"Kernel::new() → kernel.start()"},"119":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"建内核并启动；这一步完全不碰 TDLib"},"120":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"2"},"121":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"PluginLoader::new(context)"},"122":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"把四个机制 install 进 Context，生成 HostApiVTable"},"123":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"3"},"124":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url