 JSON 再交给它）；接收循环那条路\n本来就有 `Value`，所以走 `process_value`。"},"157":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                                            | 数值            | 谁跑它                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreUpdate` / `PreRoute` / `InPlugin` / `PostResponse` | 0 / 1 / 2 / 3 | `UpdatePipeline::process_value` |","table":"table-1"},"158":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                    | 数值    | 谁跑它                                          |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreToolCall` / `PostToolCall` | 4 / 5 | **目前没有生产调用方**（只有 `fuyubot-middleware` 自己的测试） |","table":"table-1"},"159":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"六阶段的数值在 `fuyubot-abi::Stage`，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应，由 `runtime.rs` 的\n`stage_numbers_match_the_middleware_crate` 测试钉住。"},"160":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"三条容易搞错的语义："},"161":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**归属是「额外定向」，不是「排除广播」**：`emit` 发给所有订阅者，`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 是\n「全局 + 该归属」。响应因此对所有插件透明。"},"162":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本\n（按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的 payload）。"},"163":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只用来选通道**，不参与负载匹配；等响应写\n`{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":N}`。"},"164":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`HostRuntime::plugin_scope()` 给这次加载分配一个 owner id，之后所有跨 ABI 的注册\n（订阅 / 工具 / 服务 / 中间件）都记在这个 owner 名下（`RegistrationKind` + `Registration`）。\n`scope.commit()` 保留；提前 drop（init 失败、start 报错、ABI 不匹配）或 `LoadedPlugin` 被 drop 时，\n`rollback_owner(owner)` 一次性撤掉这批注册；宿主自己（owner 0）不受影响。"},"165":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`LoadedPlugin` 的字段声明顺序就是卸载顺序：先 `plugin_stop`，再 `rollback_owner`，\n最后 `_lib: Library` 才 drop——到这一步动态库才真正卸载。"},"166":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"中间插件要批量托管脚本时，用**内置 scope 服务**（`get_service(\"fuyubot.host.scope\")`）开子作用域：\n`create` 出的子作用域从当前作用域栈继承 owner（脱离加载线程的场景——比如 watch 线程——要先建\nroot scope 再 `enter`，否则 owner 退化成宿主 0，卸载时回滚不到），注册落在子作用域里，\n`rollback_scope` 可以只撤这一批；插件卸载时连 owner 一起收。"},"167":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-72","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"**唯一的例外是 Go 的 c-shared 库**：它的运行时有线程与信号处理器，卸载后进程会 access violation\n（`0xC0000005`，而且崩在退出那一刻）。`PluginLoader` 用文件里的 Go buildinfo 魔数认出 Go 产物，\n对这类库 `plugin_stop` 与注册回滚照跑，但**故意不卸载那个 `Library`**，让它映射到进程退出。\n代价是「同一进程内反复加载同一个 Go 插件」不可靠（热重载路径），收益是 Go 插件能正常用。"},"168":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-73","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每个插件有两个依赖列表：`inject`（硬）与 `soft_inject`（软）。它们**只影响准入与顺序**，\n不影响加载——插件已经 `dlopen` 进来了，只是还没轮到它跑。"},"169":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-74","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖解析：硬依赖管准入，软依赖管排序"},"170":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-75","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每轮先退掉依赖已消失的，再激活一个：硬依赖不齐就停在 Pending，齐了就按「软依赖也齐的先」排序后激活；激活失败会级联到依赖它的插件。"},"171":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-76","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"插件清单"},"172":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-77","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"注册顺序 = 文件名字典序，所以同层 tie-break 是确定的"},"173":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每轮 reconcile：先退后进"},"174":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖不再满足的先 Deactivate，然后只推进一个 fiber"},"175":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"硬依赖（inject）全可用？"},"176":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"不齐"},"177":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"齐了"},"178":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending：等着"},"179":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"不是失败——提供者可能只是还没起来"},"180":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"按软依赖排序"},"181":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"软依赖也齐的先，其余排后面"},"182":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"激活这一个 fiber"},"183":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"跑 apply，注册落进它自己的作用域"},"184":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Active"},"185":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Failed"},"186":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"级联到依赖它的"},"187":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"四条规则："},"188":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**硬依赖不齐 → 不激活**，停在 `Pending`。这是「等」，不是「错」——提供者可能只是排在后面还没轮到。"},"189":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**软依赖不齐 → 照样激活**，只是排在有软依赖的后面（两轮扫描：先扫软的也齐了的，再扫其余）。"},"190":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**每轮只推进一个 fiber**，先退后进。一轮的推进量有保险丝（`2n + 16`），万一依赖图构了环也不会卡死。"},"191":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**激活失败 → 级联**：依赖它的插件一并标 `Failed`，因为那个提供者永远回不来了。"},"192":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"四种状态怎么走"},"193":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending 等到依赖齐了才进 Activating；apply 成功是 Active，报错是 Failed；Active 的依赖消失会退回 Pending。Failed 是终态。"},"194":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending"},"195":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Activating"},"196":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Active"},"197":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Failed"},"198":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-103","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖齐"},"199":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-104","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"成功"},"200":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-105","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"apply 报错"},"201":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-106","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖消失 → Deactivate（退回等着）"},"202":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-107","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"`Pending` 与 `Failed` 的分界就是「还可能好」和「不会好了」：`is_permanently_missing` 只在\n提供者**已经 Failed** 时返回真。服务表里没有、也没有同名 fiber 的依赖，一律保持 `Pending`——\n它可能是以后才出现的服务（比如另一个插件在外层作用域里 later 才 provide）。"},"203":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-108","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"进程边界：动态库插件同进程，脚本插件一进程一脚本"},"204":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-109","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"宿主进程里跑 fuyubot 本体、原生 cdylib 插件、以及 python_host / js_host 这两个中间插件；中间插件再用 uv run / bun 起子进程跑脚本。"},"205":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-110","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"宿主进程（同一个地址空间）"},"206":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-111","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"fuyubot 宿主"},"207":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-112","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"原生插件 cdylib"},"208":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-113","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"Rust / C / C++"},"209":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-114","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"中间插件 cdylib"},"210":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-115","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"python_host / js_host"},"211":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-116","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"dlopen · C ABI"},"212":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-117","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"uv run / bun"},"213":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-118","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"子进程（一进程一脚本）"},"214":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-119","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本 A"},"215":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-120","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"main.py"},"216":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-121","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本 B"},"217":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-122","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"index.ts"},"218":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-123","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本经薄 SDK 回调 → 中间插件（原生桥）→ 宿主；子进程死了宿主只记一条错，不跟着崩。"},"219":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-124","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|         | 动态库插件             | 脚本插件（目录形态）    |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| 进程 / 边界 | 与宿主同进程；C ABI 函数调用 | 一进程一脚本；经原生桥回调 |","table":"table-2"},"220":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-125","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|      | 动态库插件 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                   |\n| ---- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本定位 | 不适用   | manifest（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）声明入口 |","table":"table-2"},"221":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-126","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|     | 动态库插件                 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                 |\n| --- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 装载  | `plugin install <产物>` | `plugin install <目录>` → `plugins/scripts/` |","table":"table-2"},"222":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-127","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|           | 动态库插件     | 脚本插件（目录形态）                    |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 启动时序 / 崩溃 | 同步；崩了拖垮宿主 | 装依赖后起进程，等 `ready`；子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-2"},"223":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-128","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|       | 动态库插件                                  | 脚本插件（目录形态）           |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 已知天花板 | panic 靠 `C-unwind` + `catch_unwind` 接住 | 改代码不热载（watch 只认目录增删） |","table":"table-2"},"224":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-129","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本侧（薄 SDK 与目录形态）见文档站的\n脚本插件。\n两门语言的中间插件是同一套机制的两份实现，所以「Python SDK 与 JS SDK 对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"225":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-130","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate          | 里面有什么                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-core` | `lib.rs` 的 `Kernel`（Created → Started → Stopped）；`context.rs` 的 `Context`（`Arc<RwLock<HashMap<TypeId, Arc<dyn Any + Send + Sync>>>>`）；`effect.rs` 的 `Effect`（`Box<dyn FnOnce()>` 回滚守卫，`#[must_use]`，`merge()` 后注册者先撤销）；`plugin.rs` 的 `Plugin` trait + `define_plugin!`；`manager.rs` 的 `PluginManager`（load / load_all / unload / reload + DFS 三色拓扑排序） |","table":"table-3"},"226":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-131","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate           | 里面有什么                                                            |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-event` | `EventBus` / `Filter` / `SubscriptionHandle` / `EventContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"227":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-132","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate             | 里面有什么                                                      |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-service` | `ServiceContainer` / `ServiceHandle` / `ServiceContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"228":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-133","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate          | 里面有什么                                                                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-tool` | `ToolDescriptor` / `ToolRegistry` / `ToolHandle` / `ffi` 模块 / `ToolContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"229":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-134","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate                | 里面有什么                                                                                      |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-middleware` | `Stage` / `Middleware` / `Next` / `Pipeline` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `MiddlewareContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"230":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-135","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"三条共用约定："},"231":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-136","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**回调错误类型由 core 定**：四个 crate 不能互相依赖，所以 `fuyubot_core::Result<T>` 是全仓唯一允许 boxed error 的地方。"},"232":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-137","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**与 Context 的集成 = `install(ctx)` + 扩展 trait**：返回的 `Effect` 要一直持有，否则服务立刻从 Context 消失。"},"233":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-138","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**所有注册都返回句柄且 `#[must_use]`**：四个 Handle 内部都包着 `core::Effect`，drop 即回滚。"},"234":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-139","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"各自的一条要点："},"235":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-140","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 事件  | `emit` 在锁**外面**调回调，所以回调里再 `on` / `emit` / `off` 不会自锁；某个回调返回 `Err` 会**中断**本次广播并把错误抛出去。`Filter` 用点分路径（`\"message.chat.id\"`）做字段相等匹配 |","table":"table-4"},"236":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-141","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                        |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务  | 命名容器（跨语言插件报不出 Rust 的 `TypeId`）。同名重复注册报错；`get::<T>` 类型不匹配返回 `None`，用 `contains` + `type_of` 区分「没注册」和「类型不对」 |","table":"table-4"},"237":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-142","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 工具  | `call_tool` = 查表 → 权限门 → input_schema → 处理器 → output_schema。`handler: Option<ToolHandlerFn>`，`None` 表示「只有元数据的声明型工具」；注册/注销用 `on_change` 广播（**不认识事件系统**，要不要转成事件总线由宿主层决定） |","table":"table-4"},"238":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-143","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                   |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 中间件 | 洋葱模型，`next.run(ctx)` 前是进入段、后是退出段。`run(stage, ctx)` 会**先复制层列表再执行**，所以中间件里再 `use_middleware` 不会自锁；不调 `next.run` 就是不往下走 |","table":"table-4"},"239":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-144","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"内核的几条语义："},"240":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-145","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`Context` 只有 `&self`**：`provide` 返回 `Effect`，drop 即注销，所以调用方必须持有它。"},"241":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-146","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`Effect::merge` 是 LIFO**：`a.merge(b)` 的撤销顺序是 `b → a`。"},"242":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-147","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**加载顺序由依赖决定，卸载是加载顺序的倒序**；`load_all` 报错会把本次已加载的卸掉，不留半加载。"},"243":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-148","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**有依赖者时 `unload` 拒绝**（`HasDependents`），不级联。"},"244":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-149","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`reload` 之所以能工作**，是因为管理器存的是 `Arc<dyn Plugin>` 而不是 `Box`。"},"245":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-150","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"两个 crate 一人一半：`-sys` 只出类型、不做加载，`tdlib` 才是运行时。"},"246":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-151","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"| crate                  | `build.rs` 做什么                                 | `src/` 里有什么                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`绑定层 | 拿 `td_api.tl` + 生成编译期两份产物（无条件执行，没有 feature 早退） | `build_support.rs`（与另一个 crate 共用的缓存/下载设施）、`ffi.rs`（函数指针 + 符号名 + 指针形状 `const assert`）、`tl_schema.rs`（解析与 JSON 互转）、`tl_codegen.rs` + `docs.rs`、`schema.rs`、`td_api.rs`（`include!` 生成物） |","table":"table-5"},"247":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-152","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"| crate              | `build.rs` 做什么                        | `src/` 里有什么                                                       |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib`运行时 | 只管 vendored 动态库 + 把库 staging 到可执行文件旁边 | `loader.rs` / `loader/vendored.rs` / `client.rs` / `authorize.rs` |","table":"table-5"},"248":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-153","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"三条边界约定："},"249":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-154","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**重导出的路径不变**：`fuyubot_tdlib::` 根上重导出 `-sys` 的 `ffi` / `schema` / `td_api` /\n`tl_schema` 与 `TdApiSchema` / `EntryKind` / `TlEntry` / `TlParam` / `SchemaError` / `TdApi` /\n`DEFAULT_LOG_VERBOSITY`，所以既有调用方一行都不用改。"},"250":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-155","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**两份源码被两边共用**：`build_support.rs` 与 `loader/vendored.rs` 各自的 `build.rs` 都用 `#[path]`\n引同一份，因此它们只能依赖 std 与可选依赖。"},"251":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-156","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**两份 metadata 必须一致**：`[package.metadata.fuyubot]` 在两个 crate 里各有一份，值要对得上\n（守卫测试 `metadata_is_in_sync_between_the_two_crates`）。"},"252":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-157","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`loader::resolve` 按这个顺序找动态库："},"253":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-158","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`（文件或目录）"},"254":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-159","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**vendored 目录**"},"255":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-160","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**可执行文件所在目录**（ExeDir）"},"256":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-161","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"Linux 带版本号的系统库"},"257":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-162","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"裸库名（真去 `dlopen` 试一次）"},"258":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-163","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"全失败返回 `TdlibLoadError::NotFound`，消息里逐条列出 `[1]`…`[4]` 的尝试与原因。"},"259":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-164","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"真正加载**必须**走 `loader::open_library`（Windows 绝对路径会走 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`），\n**不要直接用 `Library::new`**——以后任何新增的加载动态库的地方都走它。"},"260":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-165","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`@extra` 是**字符串**（`RequestId::to_extra()`）；`route()` 遇到非数字的 `@extra` 会退化成更新，不 panic。"},"261":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-166","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"编译期：一份 schema 生成两份产物"},"262":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-167","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"td_api.tl 经 tl_schema::parse 解析一次，左路生成 Rust 类型源码、include! 进 td_api；右路写成 JSON、include_str! 进 TdApiSchema::compiled。两条路来自同一个解析结果，所以形状不会漂移。"},"263":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-168","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"td_api.tl"},"264":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-169","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"包内 vendor 优先 → 缓存 → 下载"},"265":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-170","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"tl_schema::parse"},"266":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-171","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"tl_codegen::generate"},"267":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-172","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"$OUT_DIR/td_api.json"},"268":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-173","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"$OUT_DIR/td_api_generated.rs"},"269":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-174","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"include_str!"},"270":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-175","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"fuyubot_tdlib_sys::td_api"},"271":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-176","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"serde 带 tag 的 enum / struct"},"272":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-177","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"TdApiSchema::compiled"},"273":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-178","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"运行时查「有没有这个方法 / 字段」"},"274":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-179","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"两份产物来自同一个解析结果，而且 `tl_schema.rs` 被 build.rs 用 `#[path]` 引同一份实现，所以「编译期\n写出来的形状」与「运行时读回去的形状」不可能漂移。生成规则：类 → 带 `#[serde(tag = \"@type\")]` 的 enum；\n函数 → 带 `METHOD` / `RESULT` 常量的 struct（派生 `Default`，没填的字段不写进请求）；类字段一律\n`Option<Box<T>>`（断互递归 + 对上「缺字段就是没有」）；认不出的类型降级成 `serde_json::Value`；Rust\n关键字转义（`r#type`）；**文档四级齐全**（类 / 变体 / 函数 / 字段）。归类只认\n`---functions---` / `---types---` 分区标记，认不出来时**构建直接失败**。\n`check_request` 那套元数据仍然保留——它做的是生成类型做不到的本地校验（生成类型只能保证**结构**对，\n挡不住「用错方法名」）。"},"275":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-180","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                      | 位置            | 作用                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable` / `PluginHandle` / `HostApi` | `fuyubot-abi` | 函数表（21 字段） / `plugin_init` 的返回值（`abi_version == 0` = 失败） / 插件侧门面 |","table":"table-6"},"276":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-181","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                                            | 位置               | 作用                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostRuntime` / `UpdatePipeline` / `PluginLoader` / `LoadedPlugin` | `fuyubot-loader` | 20 个桥的落点、请求留档、响应回投、`rollback_owner`、全局配置读写；六阶段（实跑 4 个）+ 双通道路由；dlopen 与 drop 即卸载 |","table":"table-6"},"277":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-182","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                               | 位置              | 作用                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TdClient` / `Routed` / `ReceiveLoop` | `fuyubot-tdlib` | TDLib 客户端；`route()` 分出 `Update` / `Response`；停止把手（`stop()` / `join()`，drop **不会**停） |","table":"table-6"},"278":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-183","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                    | 位置                 | 作用                                                                                                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify` / `RichMessage` | `fuyubot-simplify` | 发消息 / 相册 / 编辑 / 删除 / Markdown 转 entities / 等响应 / **富消息**（`rich` 模块，本地 Markdown → 块树）；参数是**每个方法一个结构体** |","table":"table-6"},"279":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-184","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                   | 位置                  | 作用                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `TdApiSchema::compiled()` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` | 编译期烘焙的元数据；`check_request` 做本地方法名/参数名校验 |","table":"table-6"},"280":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"page","content":"构建与测试","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test"},"281":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test","content":"三条硬门槛、两类测试，以及本机的离线约定"},"282":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"三条硬门槛"},"283":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"构建输入与缓存"},"284":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"两类测试"},"285":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"测试写法的三条规矩"},"286":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"本机的离线约定"},"287":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"⚠️ 三条都带 `--workspace`：根 `Cargo.toml` 有 `default-members = [\"crates/*\"]`，\n**裸** `cargo build` / `cargo test` 只编 `crates/`，不编 `examples/`。\n`#[allow]` 不算消 warning——能改就改。"},"288":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"`cargo tree --workspace --offline` 必须无环；依赖方向随时能用\n`cargo tree -p <crate> -e normal --depth 1` 验。"},"289":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**，`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它："},"290":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"包内那份随 crate 发布（1.8.69 已带），所以**从 crates.io 装下来的下游和 docs.rs 都不用联网**。\n它按 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] tdlib-version` 拼路径，换了版本却没补 `vendor/` 时会自动退到缓存/下载。"},"291":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"缓存根按顺序找（`build_support::cache_roots()`，两个 build.rs 共用同一串）："},"292":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把第三档指好（`relative = true`，相对仓库根），克隆下来直接能用。"},"293":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"**手写必须绝对路径**：两个 build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根，相对路径会解析到 crate 下面然后 404。"},"294":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`$OUT_DIR` 每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空 → 退到它意味着下次**重新下载**，缓存根全写不进去时会明确警告。"},"295":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"转换在编译期完成：日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于那份文件，**别当常量写进断言**。"},"296":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`.cargo/config.toml` 另有两个别名：`cargo bot`（= `fuyubot run`）、`cargo package-bot`\n（release 构建 `fuyubot` + 三个内置插件，产物在 `target/release/`，tdjson 由 build.rs 放到 exe 同级）。\n**没有 `package-sdk`**：`fuyubot-sdk` 在 FuyuBot-SDK 仓库，那边用 `cargo build -p fuyubot-sdk-cli`。"},"297":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"**默认自检不碰任何外部文件**：真 tdjson、真 `td_api.tl`（用 `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` 顶替时）、真 Releases 下载\n全部藏在 `#[ignore]` 后面。所以「全绿」只证明代码自洽——**与真实 TDLib 对不对得上只有那些\n`--ignored` 能回答**："},"298":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"改 `ffi.rs` 的符号名/arity、`loader::open_library`（或任何加载动态库的地方）、\n`tl_schema` / `tl_codegen`，或碰登录/授权代码之后，**必须**跑一次。\n`--features vendored` 那条（会尝试访问 Releases，失败只警告）在动 build 脚本 / 资产表时也要跑。"},"299":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**临时目录不许用 `%TEMP%`**：一律 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`。MSYS 会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`，\n受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了——换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"300":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**嵌套调用 cargo / 编译器时**，把子进程的 `TEMP`/`TMP` 也指到那里：MSVC 的 `link.exe`\n建不了 `%TEMP%` 里的 `lnk*.tmp`，直接 `LNK1104`，插件/夹具根本编不出来。"},"301":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"非平凡逻辑留**一个**可运行自检：`#[cfg(test)]` 里一个 `assert` 测试即可，不引测试框架。"},"302":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"DSH 沙箱里 cargo 的 TLS 连不上 crates.io（`schannel … SEC_E_NO_CREDENTIALS`）。\n`Cargo.lock` 已落盘，`--offline` 就够；**只有改依赖版本时**才需要联网，那时向用户申请一次完整权限跑\n`cargo fetch`。"},"303":{"id":"/docs/dev","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev"},"304":{"id":"/docs/dev-0","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"改框架本身：结构、构建测试、踩过的坑、发布"},"305":{"id":"/docs/dev-1","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"本节的页面"},"306":{"id":"/docs/dev-2","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"一分钟上手"},"307":{"id":"/docs/dev-3","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"这一节是给**改 fuyubot 仓库**的人看的，不是给用它写 bot 的人看的。"},"308":{"id":"/docs/dev-4","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"**公开文档都在这个文档站**：结构、ABI、插件写法、使用方式。"},"309":{"id":"/docs/dev-5","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么    | 在哪     |\n| ------ | ------ |\n| 结构与数据流 | 架构与数据流 |","table":"table-0"},"310":{"id":"/docs/dev-6","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么      | 在哪   |\n| -------- | ---- |\n| 构建、测试、发布 | 下面三页 |","table":"table-0"},"311":{"id":"/docs/dev-7","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                       | 在哪                                    |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 当前状态 / 构建契约 / 已知缺口 / 踩过的坑 | 仓库里随源码分发的工程台账（`docs/`，不入库，只给改代码的人接力用） |","table":"table-0"},"312":{"id":"/docs/dev-8","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"仓库有一条硬规矩：**文档里出现的命令必须真跑过**，带输出的示例要抄真实输出。\n改行为就同步改文档：文档站给使用者与插件作者，仓库里的工程台账给下一个改代码的人。\n否则下一个人会比你更相信旧文档。"},"313":{"id":"/docs/dev-9","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"架构与数据流\" href=\"/docs/dev/architecture/\" />"},"314":{"id":"/docs/dev-10","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"构建与测试\" href=\"/docs/dev/build-test/\" />"},"315":{"id":"/docs/dev-11","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"常见陷阱\" href=\"/docs/dev/pitfalls/\" />"},"316":{"id":"/docs/dev-12","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"发布\" href=\"/docs/dev/release/\" />"},"317":{"id":"/docs/dev-13","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`TDLIB_TD_API_TL` → 缓存 → 从 Releases 下载，拿不到就让构建失败。\n仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把缓存指到 `.tdlib-cache/`（相对仓库根），所以上面三条直接敲就行。"},"318":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"page","content":"常见陷阱","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls"},"319":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"编号即引用锚：这些坑真踩过，别再踩回去"},"320":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"ABI 与回调"},"321":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"事件语义"},"322":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"TDLib"},"323":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"Rust / Windows"},"324":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"每条都**真踩过**。这里挑最容易复发的几类；仓库内部的台账编号是跨文件引用锚，只随源码分发，不在这里展开。"},"325":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`extern \"C\"` 边界逃出去的 panic 直接 abort**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`：插件与中间件回调必须是\n`unsafe extern \"C-unwind\"`，`define_plugin!` 自己也要包一层。"},"326":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**一个 crate 只能展开一次 `define_plugin!`**：七个导出符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次必然重复定义。"},"327":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**订阅句柄必须活着**：每轮循环里 `let _h = …` 就是每轮退订；`for` 里注册要把句柄收进循环外的 `Vec`。"},"328":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`Effect` / `Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`**：`let _ =` 会立刻回滚；`drop` 就是注销。"},"329":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**归属（scope）不是「排除广播」**：第一版写成「全局 `emit` 只发 scope 0」，插件永远收不到更新。\n正确语义是「`emit` 发给所有人；`emit_scoped(scope)` 额外定向给该归属」。"},"330":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"331":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**方法名/字段路径按 TDLib 来，不按 Bot API**：只有 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`；\n`updateFile` 的 file id 在 `file.id` 不是顶层 `file_id`；`user` 没有 `is_bot` / `username`。"},"332":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**`td_api.tl` 的「函数 vs 构造器」只认 `---functions---` / `---types---` 标记**：\n`updateNewMessage … = Update` 是构造器，任何按首字母大写的启发式都会误判。"},"333":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**写死 TDLib 方法名/参数名的模块必须留一条 `check_request` 测试**（离线就能红）。"},"334":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`Context` 的固有方法会遮蔽扩展 trait 的同名方法**：命名服务只能叫 `provide_named` / `resolve`。"},"335":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**thiserror 把名为 `source` 的字段当错误链**：存额外文本的字段叫 `detail`。"},"336":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**Windows 文件锁是强制锁**：锁住的字节范围别人 `read` 会 `ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION`，\n所以实例状态把「锁」与「内容」分成两个文件（`.fuyubot/lock` 与 `.fuyubot/status`）。"},"337":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**PowerShell 的 `Get-Content` 在本机按 cp936 解码 UTF-8**：中文注释会毁，还会吞换行导致行号错位。\n改源码一律用编辑器工具，shell 只用来跑命令。"},"338":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`tar` 在 Windows runner 上要 POSIX 路径**（`/d/a/…`）：GNU tar 会把 `D:/…` 当成「连主机 D」。"},"339":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"> 新踩的坑要补进仓库的 `docs/pitfalls.md` 台账（随源码分发）并给新编号——编号是跨文件引用锚。"},"340":{"id":"/docs/dev/release","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"page","content":"发布","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release"},"341":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"两套发布资产（TDLib 库 / fuyubot 本体）与文档站的静态部署"},"342":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"TDLib 资产（构建期契约）"},"343":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"fuyubot 本体（用户下载即用）"},"344":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"文档站"},"345":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"仓库有两套**互不替代**的发布资产，tag 前缀不同，别混："},"346":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                            | tag           | 生产方                                        | 谁消费                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| TDLib 动态库 `TDLib-<os>-<arch>` | `TDLib-v<版本>` | `build-tdlib.yml` + `.github/scripts/*.sh` | 构建期（`fuyubot-tdlib` 的 loader 表） |","table":"table-0"},"347":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                                      | tag     | 生产方               | 谁消费         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| fuyubot 本体 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip` | `v<版本>` | `release-bot.yml` | 终端用户下载、解压即跑 |","table":"table-0"},"348":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"消费方是 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表，生产方是\n`.github/workflows/build-tdlib.yml` 的 matrix；`tests/release_assets.rs` 会**读 workflow 双向比对**，\n漂了就红。四条硬要求："},"349":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"tag 必须精确是 **`TDLib-v<版本>`**（下载 URL 由 `release_url()` 拼）；"},"350":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"资产名**精确等于** `ASSETS` 表的值，**不带扩展名**，`<os>-<arch>` 用 cargo 口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`）；"},"351":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"内容必须是 **`.tar.gz`**（`.zip` 会被 `extract_library` 当裸库原样写出，得到坏文件还不报错）；"},"352":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"**加平台只动 `ASSETS` 表 + CI matrix，两边同时加**（`macos/x86_64` 故意不在表里：没有那个 runner）。"},"353":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"运行时仓库的 `release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag（或手动 dispatch）上按平台编 `fuyubot-cli` 与三个内置插件，\n**构建阶段就把最终布局组好**（`plugins/` 直接填内置插件，不单独打包），每平台出一份中间\n`.tar.gz`（已是最终布局）；`publish`（Linux runner）把它转成用户下载的 zip 再挂 Release："},"354":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**资产名**：`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，例 `fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`。\n`<版本>` 取自 tag（分支上手动构建退回 `dev-<sha7>`）；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64。名字里带版本，同一页 Release 里多个构建可以并存、一眼可辨。"},"355":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**zip 解压出来就是本体**——不再套一层目录："},"356":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"`fuyubot-sdk-<os>-<arch>.zip` 由 **SDK 仓库**（`FuyuBot-SDK` 的 `release-sdk.yml`）发布，\n不混进运行时的包。"},"357":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"平台集合与 `ASSETS` 表一致：Windows / Linux 各 x86_64 + aarch64，**macOS 只有 aarch64**。"},"358":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"中间产物（每平台一份 `fuyubot-*.tar.gz`）只留在 Actions artifacts 里，**不挂 Release**——\n它是构建产物，不是发布形态。"},"359":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"三条契约：**资产名 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**、**zip 解压即本体**（无套层目录）、\n**`tdjson` 与可执行文件同级**（靠 loader 优先级 2「可执行文件所在目录」命中）。\nzip 只在 `publish`（Linux runner）里生成，Windows runner 的 bash 没有 `zip` 命令。"},"360":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"GitHub Actions 在本机验不了。改 workflow 的组包步骤时，把 `Package the runtime` 与\n`Turn each bundle into a flat zip` 两段 bash **原样抠出来在本机跑一次**，\n解压产物验证 `--version` / `init` / `run --replay` / `--no-login --background` 全通——\n这一步是踩过「改了却没验」之后定的规矩。"},"361":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"本站是静态导出（`output: 'export'`），产物 `out/`："},"362":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"**push `main` 自动构建并发布到 `gh-pages`**（`pages.yml`；Pages 的 source 是 `gh-pages` 分支）。\nGitHub Pages 是项目页（挂在 `/FuyuBot-docs/` 下）：构建前设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/FuyuBot-docs`，\n正式域名在**构建前**设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`（绝对 URL 是烘进产物的）；\n`public/.nojekyll` 不能少（`_next/` 以 `_` 开头会被 Jekyll 吞掉）。"},"363":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"发布前过一遍提交检查清单：文档站与运行时仓库里的工程台账都更新、`cargo build/test/fmt` 三条绿、\n没把凭据写进任何文件。"},"364":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"page","content":"simplify 封装是怎么实现的","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals"},"365":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"按功能范围拆开 fuyubot-simplify 的实现：等待语义、同步 td_execute、错误映射、异步线程与测试守卫"},"366":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"三条不可协商的原则"},"367":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"1. 请求出口：一切经 ABI"},"368":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"2. 文本链路：为什么不异步"},"369":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"3. 发送：两步合成一次等待"},"370":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"4. 编辑 / 删除 / 应答：只有一步"},"371":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"5. 富消息：为什么单列一条路"},"372":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"6. 等待层：三个底层出口"},"373":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"7. 命令订阅：为什么两层 Box"},"374":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"8. 异步版：一次调用一个线程"},"375":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"9. 错误映射"},"376":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"10. 真 schema 守卫（离线测试）"},"377":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#11-后加的四个子系统各自为什么这么实现","content":"11. 后加的四个子系统：各自为什么这么实现"},"378":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"管理权：为什么返回 `bool`"},"379":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"转发：为什么不等发送结局"},"380":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"表情反应：bot 与用户号是两套方法"},"381":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"连接状态：只能订阅"},"382":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"话题：`MessageTopic` 有四个构造器"},"383":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"12. 加一个新方法 / 新字段的清单"},"384":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"这一篇是给**改这一层的人**看的：为什么这么做，以及加东西时该动哪儿。\n用这一层的人请先看插件 › Simplify 封装。"},"385":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**只简化输入，不改变输出。** 返回值永远是 TDLib 的原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`），\n不带自己的包装类型。插件要能随时退回手写请求。"},"386":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**一个方法一个参数结构体 + 短字段名。** `text` / `media` / `topic_id` 这些名字只服务于「人好写」，\n到 TDLib 字段名的映射**只有一处实现**（`send_params` / `edit_*_params` / `put_common`）。\n短名字不代表裸标量：`topic_id` 是 `Topic`，\n`media` 是 `Media`——凡是有「选哪个构造器」问题的一律用枚举，不用 `i64` 让人猜。"},"387":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**公开方法都等到结果**（唯一例外是同步的 `formatted`）。请求号不外泄——泄漏就意味着调用方要自己管\n`old_message_id` / `request_id` 那一套，而这正是这一层要替人扛的东西。"},"388":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"改这一层之前先读一遍这三条：违反任何一条的改动，都应该先回来改这一节说清楚为什么要破例。"},"389":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"`Simplify` 只持有一个 `HostApi`（它是 `Copy`）。**没有一处**直接碰 `tdjson` 的符号："},"390":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"异步方法走 `host.td_invoke_simplified(\"方法名\", payload)`——`@type` 由宿主补，\n返回 `RequestId`；响应从 `\"response\"` 通道回来（只发给发起请求的那个插件）。"},"391":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"唯一走别的是 `formatted`：同步的 `host.td_execute`（下一节解释）。"},"392":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"参数 JSON 不是字符串拼接，而是 `serde_json::Map` 一层层 `insert` 出来的——每个字段「发 / 不发」\n在代码里一眼能看出来（`Option` 为 `None` 就是整个字段缺省，不是发 `null`）。"},"393":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`Text { text, parse_mode }` → `formattedText { text, entities }` 只有一条路：TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。\n**这里刻意不做第二套解析器**——一旦自己解析，「我们认的语法」和「Telegram 认的语法」就开始漂移\n（实测就已经够意外了：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，`**x**` 会被吞成 `x` 且不给 bold entity）。"},"394":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"代价是一次往返，而这次往返**必须是同步的**："},"395":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"插件通常正是在**更新回调里**发消息，而「更新」和「响应」都靠接收循环那个线程投递。\n在那儿 `td_invoke` + 等响应 = 自己卡自己的投递线程，等到的一定是超时。\n`parseTextEntities` 不碰服务器，TDLib 允许同步跑它（`td_json_client_execute`）——所以这条链路\n即使在**更新回调里**也是安全的，换成异步等待反而会把自己卡死。"},"396":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"实现上的三点："},"397":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`ParseMode::to_td()` 把四个模式换成三个 `TextParseMode`（`Plain` 返回 `None`，直接跳过请求）；"},"398":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"拿不到结果（没接 TDLib / 报错 / 回了个别的）→ `formatted_from` 退回纯文本，并打一条 `Warn`；\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该让整条消息发不出去；"},"399":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`formatted` 作为**渲染闭包**传进 `send_params(.., render)` / `edit_*_params(.., render)`，\n所以每个发送 / 编辑方法都自动得到「文本的最终形态」，不需要各自处理解析。"},"400":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"TDLib 是异步的，`sendMessage` 的真相是这样的："},"401":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"封装把 ②③ 合成一次（见 `await_response` / `await_outcome`）："},"402":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_response`：等 `\"response\"` 通道，`request_id` 精确匹配；`@type == \"error\"` → `SimplifyError::Tdlib`；"},"403":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_outcome`：走**兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道** + `\"old_message_id\"` 匹配。成功与失败两条更新都在这条通道上，\n所以一次等待就能拿到「到底成了没」；按临时消息的 id 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来。"},"404":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"**超时先补救**：`cancel_sending` 用 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条还没发出去的消息撤掉，\n再返回 `Timeout(u64)`。发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消。这一步**只打日志**，不把删除的成败返回结果。"},"405":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"相册是同一套的 N 倍：`sendMessageAlbum` 的响应是 `Messages`（一组），`pending_messages` 取出每一项的临时 id，\n然后**逐项** `await_outcome`。`timeout_ms` 是**整组共用一个预算**——方法是把 deadline 算出来，\n每次只剩 `remaining_ms(deadline)`，不是每项各重新计时。"},"406":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`AlbumSize` 是**发之前**挡下来的（`invoke_send_album` 里先验 2–10 项），因为一个错项数的相册\n发出去也只会让服务端拒绝，不如在本地给个清脆的错误。"},"407":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"这类方法**没有结局更新**——结果就是响应本身："},"408":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"成功 ⇒ `Message`（编辑）或 `ok`（删除 / 应答）；"},"409":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`@type == \"error\"` ⇒ `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（`Message is not modified`、消息太老删不动都在这一档）。"},"410":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"**这里刻意不重试**：该等多久是限流策略的事，调用方比封装层更清楚。"},"411":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`editMessageReplyMarkup` 是真签名里 `reply_markup` **必填**的那个（`chat_id message_id reply_markup`），\n所以「不要键盘」不能靠省略字段表示，必须发 `replyMarkupRemoveKeyboard`——`edit_markup_params` 用\n`entry(..).or_insert_with(..)` 兜住这一点。相册要挂键盘就只能先发、再用这条改。"},"412":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"`messageRichMessage` 与普通消息的互斥规则完全不同（那边「文本 / 媒体」二选一，这边是一棵树），\n所以它有独立参数类型 `RichMessageParams` 与独立的构造入口（`RichMessage`）。"},"413":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"特殊性在于：**Markdown/HTML 源由服务端解析且仅 bot 可用**，让 local 之间也就没有中间态可看。\n为了让用户号也能写 Markdown，`fuyubot-simplify` 带了一份**受控子集**的本地转换器\n（`markdown` 模块 → `InputPageBlock` 块树）：认不出的一律退回普通文本，不报错。\n按钮在 Markdown 里没有语法，所以是显式的 `RichButton` + `with_button_row`。"},"414":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-49","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"实现细节、覆盖表与测试分工在插件 › 富消息，这里不重复——\n**只记住一条**：发/编辑也只是 `sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，\n出口仍然只有一个。"},"415":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-50","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"公开方法底下其实只有三种等待："},"416":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-51","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                              | 等什么     | 过滤器                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `wait_response(request_id, ms)` | 某个请求的响应 | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"417":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-52","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                            | 等什么     | 过滤器                       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, ms)` | 一条匹配的更新 | `UpdateFilter::to_json()` |","table":"table-0"},"418":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-53","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                    | 等什么                          | 过滤器                                   |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` 内部的循环 | 一组 `updateFile`，直到 completed | `{\"event_type\":\"update\",\"file.id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"419":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-54","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里有个容易写错的地方：`update_type` 落在 **`event_type` 键**（通道选择），\n其余条件才是对负载的字段匹配；普通更新把消息包在 `message` 里（所以条件是 `message.chat_id`），\n而 `updateNewCallbackQuery` 这类把字段放在顶层（`UpdateFilter::flat` 切的就是这个前缀）。"},"420":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-55","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`wait_for_update` 返回的 `WaitHandle::payload_json` 是宿主的**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用前有效；\n`wait_for_update_json` 内部用 `payload_of` 当场拷成 `Value`。凡是跨越宿主调用的，都要拷。"},"421":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-56","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"`on_command` 把 Rust 闭包交给 C 回调，`user_data` 必须是一个**稳定**的指针："},"422":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"外层 Box 活着时，内层 Box 的地址不变；传给 ABI 的是**内层 Box 的胖指针目标地址**（瘦指针），\ntrampoline 里再还原成 `&Box<dyn Fn(..)>`。所有权整体压在 `CommandSubscription` 上，\n所以 **drop = 退订**（`Drop` 里调 `host.off(handle)`），语义跟 `Effect` 一致。"},"423":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"trampoline 是 `extern \"C-unwind\"`（宿主要求），并且对所有空指针先 `return -1` / `0`，不会 panic 过 FFI。"},"424":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"`*_then` 的实现就三行——`spawn_then(move || simplify.xxx(..), on_done)`："},"425":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"因为等待必须是阻塞的（上层 API 就是这么设计的），要「不阻塞」只能换线程。代价是每次调用一个 OS 线程\n（有 `timeout_ms` 兜着，不会一直挂着），并且 `JoinHandle` 必须交回插件——**插件卸载前要 join**，\n否则动态库卸载之后线程还在执行库里的代码。这是 Gotcha，不是建议。"},"426":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"这一层**不引入 async runtime**：阻塞 + 线程已经够表达这套语义，而且 `HostApi` 本身是同步的 C ABI。"},"427":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 请求本身就发不出去（ABI 层） | `Abi(AbiError)`（宿主没接 TDLib 时也会在这里冒泡） |","table":"table-1"},"428":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源        | 变体          |\n| --------- | ----------- |\n| 参数串里含 NUL | `BadString` |","table":"table-1"},"429":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                     | 变体                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 响应是 `@type == \"error\"` | `Tdlib { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"430":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                        | 变体                             |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `updateMessageSendFailed` | `SendFailed { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"431":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体             |\n| ---------------- | -------------- |\n| 到期没结局（**已先撤回**过） | `Timeout(u64)` |","table":"table-1"},"432":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                                    | 变体                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 本地校验挡下来的（相册项数、空的富消息 / 按钮行、源不是块树、转发条数） | `AlbumSize` / `EmptyRichMessage` / `RichSourceNotBlocks` / `EmptyButtonRow` / `EmptyForward` / `TooManyForward` |","table":"table-1"},"433":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"身份类查询（`me` / `chat_member`）走的是另一条路：**不把错误往上传**。\n调用方只想要「有 / 没有管理权」，不该被迫处理 TDLib 的错误码，所以内部 `soften`\n把 `error` 响应记一行 `Warn` 之后当成「没拿到」，再由上层的 `bool` 方法折成 `false`。"},"434":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"区分 `Tdlib` 与 `SendFailed` 是有意的：**方法被拒绝**和**发出去了但没发成**是两回事，\n调用方的处理也不一样（前者通常是用法错，后者通常是限流 / 权限）。"},"435":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"靠肉眼对 `td_api.tl` 是靠不住的（本文开头那批方法名以前就按 Bot API 拼错过一次），\n所以每次改动都要过这几条离线测试："},"436":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema`：`TdApiSchema::compiled()`\n（编译期从 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据）逐条 `check_request(\"方法名\", &payload)`——\n参数名写错、漏字段、多发字段都会失败，**不需要联网**；"},"437":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-72","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_media_kind_becomes_one_send_message` / `media_setters_touch_only_the_variants_that_have_the_field`：\n七个 `Media` 变体各自的 `inputMessage*` 形状，以及「链式设置器只在有这个字段的变体上生效」；"},"438":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-73","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`album_rejects_wrong_sizes` / `edit_reply_markup_is_how_an_album_gets_a_keyboard`：\n上面两节说的那些边界；"},"439":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-74","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table` / `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for`\n（在 `rich.rs`）：本地 Markdown 转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表一类一例，加块 / 删块会让它失败。"},"440":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-75","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"上面第一条只覆盖「离线也发得出去」的那些请求。**要走账号分支的**（比如 bot 专用的\n`setMessageReactions`）离线根本走不到，所以 `chat.rs` 里另有一条\n`new_request_shapes_pass_the_real_schema`：直接把 `*_params` 函数拼出来的形状喂给\n`check_request`。加新方法时**两边都要接**：前者靠在 schema 测试里补一次调用，后者靠补一个 case。"},"441":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-76","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"嵌套构造器的名字同样要验：`every_message_topic_constructor_is_reachable` 检查四个\n`MessageTopic` 构造器的 `@type` 与字段名都还在真 `td_api.tl` 里（见下一节）。"},"442":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-77","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"在线行为（`cargo test -p fuyubot-tdlib -- --ignored`）验证的是「真库认不认这些值」，与上面这层互补。"},"443":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"TDLib 里没有「这个人是不是管理员」这种字段：`user` 连 `is_bot` 都没有（身份在 `user.type`），\n管理权只在 `getChatMember` 的 `ChatMember.status` 里。所以："},"444":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`chat_member()` 拿原始 `ChatMember`（想要细节就用它）；"},"445":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` 直接返回 `bool`——**不是 `Result<bool>`**。\n查不到的四种情况（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊 / 拿不到自己 id）答案都一样：\n「不确定」时说「没有」比说「有」安全，让调用方处理一堆「其实是没查到」的 `Err` 没有价值。"},"446":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"「自己」没有捷径：`getChat` 不带「我是不是管理员」，只能 `getMe` 拿 id 再 `getChatMember`。\n两次等待**各用一份** `timeout_ms`。"},"447":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"群主（`chatMemberStatusCreator`）**没有** `rights` 结构，所以除了 `is_anonymous`（它在 creator\n自己的字段上）以外一律算「有」——`is_admin_status` 里这个分支是显式的。"},"448":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`forwardMessages` 的响应是 `Messages`，和 `sendMessage` 一样是**还没发完**的临时消息。\n这里刻意只等响应：转发的成败通常不参与后续逻辑，多等一轮（N 条 `updateMessageSend*`）不划算。\nTDLib 单项失败时在对应位置放 `null`，所以调用方仍能按位判断。"},"449":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`message_ids` 在 `forward_params` 里**排序去重**：TDLib 要求严格递增，而调用方手里的 id 多半\n是从若干条更新里攒出来的。"},"450":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                  | bot                                  |\n| --- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 加一个 | `addMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions`（**bot 只能用这个**） |","table":"table-2"},"451":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                     | bot                        |\n| --- | ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 去掉  | `removeMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions` 传空列表 |","table":"table-2"},"452":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"语义差别是真实的：用户是「在已有反应上追加 / 删掉指定的一个」，bot 是「整组覆盖」。\n所以 bot 侧的 `unreact` **忽略** `reaction` 参数直接清空——这一点写在方法文档里，不要当 bug 修。"},"453":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type`，也就是每次 `react` 多一次往返。**这里刻意不做缓存**：\n`Simplify` 是 `Copy` 且无状态，加个进程级 `OnceLock` 会让「离线环境拿到过什么」变成隐藏状态，\n测试也会被污染。调用方已经知道自己是哪种时，直接调 `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` 就绕开了。"},"454":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"TDLib 没有 `getConnectionState`，状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 出现且**不重放**——\n所以只能订阅并记住最新那条，`ConnectionTracker` 就是干这个的："},"455":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"与第 7 节的「两层 Box」同一个道理：结构体会**按值返回**（被移动），\n只有堆上那一份的地址能交出去给 ABI。所有权压在 `ConnectionTracker` 上，所以 **drop = 退订**。"},"456":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"`is_ready()` 对「还没收到过任何更新」也返回 `false`——宁可保守，别把「不知道」当「连上了」。\n⚠️ 这是**连接**状态，不是授权状态：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"457":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`sendMessage` / `sendMessageAlbum` / `forwardMessages` 的 `topic_id` 是 `MessageTopic`，\n**不是**一个裸 id："},"458":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicForum { forum_topic_id: int32 }` —— **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊；"},"459":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicThread { message_thread_id: int53 }` —— **非论坛**群组的评论串；"},"460":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicDirectMessages` / `messageTopicSavedMessages`。"},"461":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，等于在非论坛群以外全错，所以改成 `Topic` 枚举并\n**不给 `From<i64>`**：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种。"},"462":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**参数结构体**（一个方法一个，字段用短名字）→ `Default`（`timeout_ms` 用 `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS`）；"},"463":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**请求组装函数** `xxx_params(.., render)`：`@type` 不要自己写（那是宿主补的），\n字段名以真 `td_api.tl` 为准；"},"464":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**`Simplify` 上的方法**：阻塞版等到结果 + 同名 `*_then`（见第 8 节）；"},"465":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补测试**：先让 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 盖住新请求；"},"466":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补文档**：插件 › Simplify 封装 里按**功能范围**归到对应那一节，\n别新开章节堆在末尾。"},"467":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"方法名 / 字段名**不要按 Telegram Bot API 的直觉写**。TDLib 里一切发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n媒体类型在 `input_message_content.@type` 里；话题是 `topic_id`（而且是 `MessageTopic`，\n论坛话题是 `messageTopicForum` **不是** `messageTopicThread`）、回复是 `reply_to`、\n没有顶层 `caption`。要查就查真 `td_api.tl`（或 `fuyubot-sdk td-method <名字>`）。"},"468":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 文档","tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"469":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架"},"470":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个 CLI，职责严格分离"},"471":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"现在能验证到什么程度"},"472":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#下一步","content":"下一步"},"473":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**fuyubot** 是一个基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架：Rust 内核 + C ABI 插件 + 多语言 SDK。\n插件就是一个动态库（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`），一个 cdylib 就是一个插件。"},"474":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用文档\" href=\"/docs/usage/\" description=\"下载安装、配置文件、运行、回放、实例管理与排错\" />"},"475":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"插件开发\" href=\"/docs/plugin/\" description=\"Rust / C / C++ / Python / JS / TS 插件、事件、TDLib 调用与 ABI\" />"},"476":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"开发文档\" href=\"/docs/dev/\" description=\"改框架本身：架构、构建测试、常见陷阱、发布\" />"},"477":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 文档\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" description=\"fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk 的完整命令参考\" />"},"478":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI       | 干什么 | 子命令                                           |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架 | `init` / `run` / `status` / `stop` / `plugin` |","table":"table-0"},"479":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI           | 干什么 | 子命令                                                                       |\n| ------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件 | `init` / `codegen` / `check` / `abi-version` / `td-methods` / `td-method` |","table":"table-0"},"480":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个都**不编译、不打包插件**——编译是插件作者用自己语言工具链（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）完成的事，\n`fuyubot plugin install` 只负责把编好的产物**复制**进插件目录。"},"481":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"离线回放（`--replay`）与实例三件套（单实例锁 / 后台运行 / `status` / `stop`）是端到端跑过的。\n真实账号登录 `run` 会接上 TDLib 走授权状态机，但**没有拿真账号端到端验过**「收真更新 → 插件回一条」。"},"482":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"内核、插件 ABI、加载器、更新管线、四大机制：有测试，全绿"},"483":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"真 TDLib（真 `tdjson` + 真 `td_api.tl`）：`getMe` 往返、同步 `execute`、插件调 TDLib 收响应，都在 `-- --ignored` 自检里验过"},"484":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"`td_api.tl` 在**编译期**被转成元数据烤进二进制，运行时不读文件、不解析"},"485":{"id":"/docs-16","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"`tdjson` **运行时动态加载**，构建期会把它拷到可执行文件同级目录"},"486":{"id":"/docs-17","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"**普通用户**：到 Releases 下对应平台的包，解压就跑 ——\n见 下载与安装"},"487":{"id":"/docs-18","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要自己编：见 从源码构建"},"488":{"id":"/docs-19","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要写插件：看 插件总览"},"489":{"id":"/docs-20","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"想改框架：看 开发文档"},"490":{"id":"/docs-21","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"卡住了：看 常见问题"},"491":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"page","content":"ABI 契约","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi"},"492":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"HostApiVTable、导出符号、内存所有权与版本协商"},"493":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件必须导出的符号"},"494":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"HostApiVTable：`host_ctx` + 20 个函数指针"},"495":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"服务作用域"},"496":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"内存所有权：三条硬规矩"},"497":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本协商"},"498":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"simplify 操作表"},"499":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"结果怎么回来"},"500":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"入参的形状"},"501":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"操作清单"},"502":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"为什么本 ABI 一个可变参数函数指针都没有"},"503":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"五种语言各自声明的兼容 ABI 版本"},"504":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"回调为什么是 `C-unwind`"},"505":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"这是**唯一**的跨语言契约：形状只有 `fuyubot-abi/src/lib.rs` 一份实现，C 头文件\n`fuyubot_plugin.h` 由 cbindgen 从它生成（**产物，不是源码**，别手改）。宿主侧所有桥在\n`fuyubot-loader/src/runtime.rs`。**改 ABI = 改那个文件 + 加版本号。**"},"506":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"v3 的四个契约符号仍是必需/可选的底线；v4 另外导出三个**静态符号**，让\n`fuyubot-sdk check` 不 dlopen 也能看见插件是按哪个 ABI 编的（版本值仍只能运行时判定）。"},"507":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                                           | 必须吗    | 说明                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*const HostApiVTable) -> PluginHandle` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"508":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号             | 类型                                                         | 必须吗 | 说明                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle, *const c_char) -> i32` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件；返回 `0` 成功 |","table":"table-0"},"509":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                   | 必须吗 | 说明             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"510":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                  | 必须吗    | 说明                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*mut c_char)` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"511":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | v4 可选 | 版本不匹配、不能调 `plugin_stop` 时，用来释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"512":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                    | 类型                              | 必须吗   | 说明                                     |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> u32` | v4 可选 | 返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态工具只检查“存在”，值要运行时看 |","table":"table-0"},"513":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                | 类型                                        | 必须吗   | 说明                                                                                                       |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> *const c_char` | v4 可选 | 自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读；名字与 `init` 不一致只告警，依赖以 manifest 为准 |","table":"table-0"},"514":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"符号名由常量钉住（`SYM_PLUGIN_INIT` / `SYM_PLUGIN_START` / `SYM_PLUGIN_STOP` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_STRING` / `SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_HANDLE` / `SYM_PLUGIN_ABI_VERSION` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_MANIFEST`），`PluginLoader::load_with_config` 按这些名字 `lib.get(...)`。\nC++ 里必须把它们放进 `extern \"C\"` 块，否则名字被 mangle，宿主 dlsym 不到。"},"515":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"`PluginHandle` = `{ abi_version: u32, size: u32, context: *mut c_void, name: *const c_char }`；\n`is_valid()` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以插件的 `context` 不能是\n`NULL`。`PluginHandle::FAILED` 是全零版本号，`const _` 里有\n`assert!(PluginHandle::FAILED.abi_version == 0)`。"},"516":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"宿主拿一个 cdylib 之后，按这个顺序敲你的符号——右边那条岔路是版本不匹配时的走法："},"517":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件符号的调用时序与版本不匹配时的岔路"},"518":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"宿主先 dlopen 并按名字 dlsym 七个符号，然后读 manifest 决定激活顺序，再调 plugin_init 校验 VTable；版本不匹配时只能调 plugin_free_handle 而不能调 plugin_stop，匹配则进 plugin_start、运行、最后 plugin_stop 与回滚。"},"519":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"1 · dlopen + dlsym 七个符号"},"520":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"C++ 要放进 extern \"C\""},"521":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"2 · plugin_manifest（v4 可选）"},"522":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"决定激活顺序"},"523":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"3 · plugin_init(&amp;VTable) → PluginHandle"},"524":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"先比 version 再比 size"},"525":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"不匹配"},"526":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"拒绝加载"},"527":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"abi_version == 0"},"528":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"plugin_free_handle"},"529":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"不能调 stop"},"530":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"4 · plugin_start(handle, config_json)"},"531":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"订阅 / 工具 / 中间件"},"532":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"5 · 运行：事件回调与 td_invoke"},"533":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"6 · plugin_stop → 回滚这批注册"},"534":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"最后才卸载 cdylib"},"535":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"plugin_free_string：谁分配谁释放"},"536":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"三点值得记住：`plugin_manifest` 在 `plugin_init` **之前**读（宿主得先知道你的依赖才能排顺序）；\n版本不匹配时**只能**用 `plugin_free_handle` 收尾，那一刻 `plugin_stop` 不会被调；\n卸载顺序是 `plugin_stop` → 回滚注册 → 最后才 drop 那个 `Library`。"},"537":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"`version` 在偏移 0、`size` 在 4、`host_ctx` 在 8，其余 **20 个是函数指针**，全是 `Option<...>`；\n总大小 = `2 * size_of::<u32>() + 23 * size_of::<*const c_void>()`（`host_ctx` + 22 个函数），\n由 `const _` 里的 `offset_of!` / `size_of` 断言钉死。每个函数第一个参数都是 `host: *mut c_void`。"},"538":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"下表签名省略第一个参数 `host`："},"539":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段        | 签名    | 宿主实现          | 说明                                        |\n| --- | --------- | ----- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| —   | `version` | `u32` | `ABI_VERSION` | 必须等于 `ABI_VERSION`；首个字段，插件能在读其它任何字段之前先比一次 |","table":"table-1"},"540":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名    | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                  |\n| --- | ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| —   | `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<HostApiVTable>()` | 老宿主 + 新插件时先比 `size` 再读尾部字段，读越界就是 UB |","table":"table-1"},"541":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段         | 签名            | 宿主实现           | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| —   | `host_ctx` | `*mut c_void` | `&HostRuntime` | 每个函数都原样回传；插件作者看不见它（`HostApi` 自动带上） |","table":"table-1"},"542":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段   | 签名                                                                      | 宿主实现     | 说明                                                                         |\n| --- | ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | `on` | `(update_type, filter_json, callback, user_data) -> SubscriptionHandle` | `api_on` | 订阅；`filter_json` 里的 `event_type` 选通道，其余键做负载匹配；`NULL` / 空串 / `\"null\"` = 收全部 |","table":"table-1"},"543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名               | 宿主实现      | 说明                   |\n| --- | ----- | ---------------- | --------- | -------------------- |\n| 2   | `off` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_off` | 退订；句柄 drop 时宿主也会整批回滚 |","table":"table-1"},"544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名                                  | 宿主实现       | 说明                                              |\n| --- | ------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | `emit` | `(event_type, payload_json) -> i32` | `api_emit` | 发自定义事件；对插件而言是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`，只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-1"},"545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段              | 签名                                                    | 宿主实现                | 说明                                                                                                    |\n| --- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | `register_tool` | `(descriptor_json, handler, user_data) -> ToolHandle` | `api_register_tool` | 登记元数据 + 可选处理器；处理器是 `C-unwind fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，只登记元数据用 `register_tool_meta` |","table":"table-1"},"546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                                | 宿主实现            | 说明                                          |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | `call_tool` | `(name, input_json) -> RequestId` | `api_call_tool` | 走 `ToolRegistry::call_tool` 的请求号路径（兼容/异步工具） |","table":"table-1"},"547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                 | 签名                                    | 宿主实现                   | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | `call_tool_result` | `(name, input_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_call_tool_result` | **同步**执行工具并返回结果 JSON（失败 `{\"error\":…}`）。宿主线程局部缓冲，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                    | 宿主实现             | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 7   | `list_tools` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_tools` | 全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段             | 签名                    | 宿主实现               | 说明                                    |\n| --- | -------------- | --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| 8   | `list_plugins` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_plugins` | 进程内插件报告 JSON 数组（名字 / 状态 / 缺依赖 / 失败原因） |","table":"table-1"},"550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 9   | `provide_service` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service` | 注册命名服务到**调用者自己的作用域**（默认私有，兄弟插件看不见）；`vtable` 必须活到注销为止 |","table":"table-1"},"551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名                               | 宿主实现              | 说明                                |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 10  | `get_service` | `(name) -> *const ServiceVTable` | `api_get_service` | 从调用者自己的作用域**沿父链**向上查找；没有就是 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                           | 宿主实现            | 说明                           |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 11  | `td_invoke` | `(method_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke` | 发完整 TDLib 请求 JSON（含 `@type`） |","table":"table-1"},"553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                     | 签名                                        | 宿主实现                       | 说明                                                      |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 12  | `td_invoke_simplified` | `(method_name, params_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke_simplified` | 给参数补上 `@type = method_name`；参数不是对象就整份替换成 `{\"@type\": …}` |","table":"table-1"},"554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 13  | `td_execute` | `(request_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的方法（`td_json_client_execute`），当场返回响应 JSON。**不发请求号、不进请求留档、不等响应通道**——所以能在事件回调里用；宿主没接 TDLib 时返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段               | 签名                                                      | 宿主实现                 | 说明                     |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 14  | `use_middleware` | `(stage: u32, callback, user_data) -> MiddlewareHandle` | `api_use_middleware` | 挂在某个阶段；回调返回非 0 → 本阶段中断 |","table":"table-1"},"556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                             | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                           |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 15  | `wait_for_update` | `(filter_json, timeout_ms: u64) -> WaitHandle` | `api_wait_for_update` | **阻塞**当前线程；`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态。Rust 插件优先用 `ResponseRouter` 的 await 版 |","table":"table-1"},"557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名               | 宿主实现              | 说明         |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| 16  | `cancel_wait` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_cancel_wait` | 从另一个线程取消等待 |","table":"table-1"},"558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名                            | 宿主实现      | 说明                                                              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 17  | `log` | `(level: u32, message) -> ()` | `api_log` | 落进宿主环形缓冲（`LOG_CAPACITY = 256`）并打一行到 stderr；非法 level 按 `Info` 处理 |","table":"table-1"},"559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 18  | `get_config` | `(section, key) -> *const c_char` | `api_get_config` | 读全局配置：`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` / `[telegram]` 等），否则把 `section` 当点路径在 `plugin` 表里下钻（`fuyubot.manage` → `plugin.fuyubot.manage`）；`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃；段 / 键不存在返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                         | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                    |\n| --- | ------------ | -------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 19  | `set_config` | `(key, value_json) -> i32` | `api_set_config` | 写配置：**只能写调用者自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。`key` 空串覆盖整段、否则按点路径设键。返回 0 = 成功（写内存 + 回写 `fuyubot.toml`）；非 0 = 越权 / 解析失败 / 写盘失败 |","table":"table-1"},"561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                       | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                                                     |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 20  | `provide_service_shared` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service_shared` | 注册到**进程级**（所有插件可见，这也是宿主那四个机制所在的层级）。同名会撞，只在真要共享时用。v4 起追加在 VTable **尾部** |","table":"table-1"},"562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                       | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                                         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------------------ | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 21  | `simplify_invoke` | `(op_json) -> RequestId` | `api_simplify_invoke` | **跨语言跑一个 simplify 操作**（v5）。宿主起工作线程执行，结果照 `@request_id` 回投到 `\"response\"` 通道。见「simplify 操作表」 |","table":"table-1"},"563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--20-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                       | 签名                           | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                                                                            |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 22  | `simplify_invoke_result` | `(op_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑一个不碰网络的 simplify 操作，当场返回结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲）。回调里安全；传异步 op 返回 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-1"},"564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"每个插件加载时拿到**自己的一层 `Context`**，于是："},"565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"`provide_service` 注册的服务只对本插件（和它更深的子作用域）可见——**默认私有**。\n两个插件注册同名服务**不冲突**，各用各的实现。"},"566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"宿主注册在根上的公共服务（事件总线 / 服务容器 / 工具表 / 中间件管线）沿父链照样看得到。"},"567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"真要跨插件共享才用 `provide_service_shared`：它写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞\n（直接报 `ServiceNameExists`）。"},"568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"插件卸载时，它那层作用域连同里面的服务一起消失。"},"569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"两条形状上的硬要求："},"570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"**第一个参数总是 `host: *mut c_void`**：裸函数指针没有捕获环境，VTable 里放不了闭包；\n不给显式上下文就只能靠进程级全局，那样一个进程只能有一个宿主、测试也没法并行。"},"571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"**每个函数指针字段都是 `Option<...>`**：C 侧传 `NULL` 合法，非 `Option` 字段收到 `NULL` 就是 UB。\nRust 侧 `HostApi::from_raw` 一次解包校验全部 22 个，之后调用路径上没有 `Option`、也没有 panic 分支。"},"572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"句柄类型（`SubscriptionHandle` / `ToolHandle` / `ServiceHandle` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `RequestId`）\n都是 `#[repr(C)]` + 单个 `u64`（断言钉住 `size_of == size_of::<u64>()`）；\n`LogLevel` = 1..5（`Error` / `Warn` / `Info` / `Debug` / `Trace`），`Stage` = 0..5；\n`WaitHandle` = `{ id: u64, matched: u32, _reserved: u32, payload_json: *const c_char }`。"},"573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**谁分配谁释放**。插件通过 `plugin_init` 返回的 `name`、以及插件自己分配的任何字符串，\n都由插件持有；宿主**绝不** free 它们。插件要给宿主一个需要接管的临时字符串，只能走\n`plugin_free_string` 那套约定。"},"574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**宿主返回的字符串是线程局部缓冲**。`list_tools`、`get_config`、`WaitHandle::payload_json`\n指向宿主的一块复用缓冲（`thread_local! HOST_STRING`），**只在下一次调用宿主函数之前有效**。\n要留着就当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**——VTable 里没有 host 侧的 free 函数，这是设计不是遗漏。"},"575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**`ServiceMethodFn` 的返回值由提供方持有**，调用方读完即弃。"},"576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比           | 不匹配的后果 |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------ |\n| `ABI_VERSION`（当前 `5`） | 编译期常量，两侧共同引用 | —      |","table":"table-2"},"577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                       | 谁比                      | 不匹配的后果                      |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::version` | 插件侧 `HostApi::from_raw` | `AbiError::VersionMismatch` |","table":"table-2"},"578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                     |\n| --------------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::size` | 同上  | `AbiError::VTableTooSmall` |","table":"table-2"},"579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置             | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                               |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 某个函数指针是 `NULL` | 同上  | `AbiError::MissingFunction(\"<字段名>\")` |","table":"table-2"},"580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                          | 谁比                 | 不匹配的后果                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `PluginHandle::abi_version` | 宿主侧 `PluginLoader` | `AbiMismatch`：**拒绝加载** |","table":"table-2"},"581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不能**调 `plugin_stop`——那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。v4 起插件可以\n导出 `plugin_free_handle`，让宿主在版本不匹配时释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态；老插件没有\n这个符号，那部分内存仍然回收不了。字段只增不改，新增一律追加在尾部。"},"582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 2 的改动**：尾部追加了 `td_execute`（同步执行，见上表第 13 项）。"},"583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 3 的改动**：尾部追加了 `get_config` / `set_config`（第 18 / 19 项），让插件能读全局配置、\n写自己的段。"},"584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 5 的改动**：尾部追加 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（第 21 / 22 项），\n把 `fuyubot-simplify` 的语义下沉到宿主——**所有语言**的插件都能用「发消息等结局 / 超时撤回 /\nbot 与用户号挑不同反应方法 / Markdown → entities / 富消息本地块树」，不再只有 Rust 有。\n详见「simplify 操作表」。`ABI_VERSION` 跳到 5，旧插件重新编一次即可。"},"585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 4 的改动**："},"586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"`register_tool` 增加 `handler` / `user_data`，工具终于能真的执行；"},"587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `call_tool_result`（同步拿工具结果）与 `list_plugins`（插件报告）；"},"588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `provide_service_shared`（第 20 项）：服务默认按插件作用域隔离，要共享得显式走它；"},"589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"新增静态导出 `plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`。"},"590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"追加字段本身不破坏老插件（它们先比 `size`），但按契约「改 ABI 就加版本号」，\n`ABI_VERSION` 一起跳到 4——**用旧版本编出来的插件会被宿主拒绝加载**，重新编一次即可\n（仓库里所有插件与模板都从 `ABI_VERSION` 取值）。"},"591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"`simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 收的是一张**操作表**而不是「一个方法一个函数指针」："},"592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"**为什么不是 20 个函数指针**：那样以后每加一个方法都要升一次 ABI 版本、三个仓库一起动。\n一张表之后，**加操作不动 ABI**。"},"593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"`simplify_invoke` 返回 `RequestId`，结果走**既有的** `\"response\"` 通道回到发起插件——\nJS/TS 的 `invokeAsync`、Python 的 `invoke_async`、Go 的 channel、Rust 的 `ResponseRouter`\n全都原样接住，没有新的回投机制。负载长这样（成功失败同形状，只看 `ok`）："},"594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"`error.code` 是稳定的英文代号，可以拿它分支：`timeout` / `send_failed` / `tdlib` /\n`missing_field` / `bad_args` / `unknown_op` / `async_op` / `host`。"},"595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"`args` 基本就是对应 TDLib 方法的参数（键名以 `td_api.tl` 为准），**认不出的键原样透传**\n（宿主照 schema 只警告不拦，TDLib 升版加了新参数也不用等 ABI）。外加两个统一项："},"596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"`timeout_ms`（默认 30 000）：整次操作共用的等待预算；"},"597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"文本字段（`text` / `caption`）可以是字符串（按纯文本），也可以是\n`{\"text\":\"…\",\"parse_mode\":\"markdown|markdown_v2|html\"}`——宿主替你走 `parseTextEntities`\n换成 `formattedText`。已经是 `formattedText` 就原样放过。"},"598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"同步（不碰网络，`simplify_invoke_result` 也能跑，回调里安全）："},"599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                    | args                  | 返回              |\n| --------------------- | --------------------- | --------------- |\n| `parse_text_entities` | `text` / `parse_mode` | `formattedText` |","table":"table-3"},"600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                   | args                                              | 返回                                                                     |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `rich_from_markdown` | `markdown` / `is_rtl` / `detect_automatic_blocks` | `inputMessageRichText`（可直接塞进 `send_message` 的 `input_message_content`） |","table":"table-3"},"601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op         | args | 返回                         |\n| ---------- | ---- | -------------------------- |\n| `list_ops` | —    | `{\"sync\":[…],\"async\":[…]}` |","table":"table-3"},"602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"异步（要等 TDLib 应答，只能走 `simplify_invoke`）："},"603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op             | 语义                                                       |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `send_message` | 发 → 等响应拿临时消息 → 等**发送结局**；超时先 `deleteMessages(revoke)` 撤回 |","table":"table-4"},"604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                   | 语义                    |\n| -------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `send_message_album` | 整组一个预算，逐项等结局，任一项失败即返回 |","table":"table-4"},"605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                                                                                                | 语义                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `edit_message_text` / `edit_message_caption` / `edit_message_media` / `edit_message_reply_markup` | 等响应（`edit_message_reply_markup` 不给 `reply_markup` = 移除键盘） |","table":"table-4"},"606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                | 语义                                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `delete_messages` | `chat_id` / `message_ids` / `revoke` |","table":"table-4"},"607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                      | 语义                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `answer_callback_query` | 点了内联按钮必须回，否则客户端一直转圈 |","table":"table-4"},"608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                 | 语义                               |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `forward_messages` | `message_ids` 排序去重、最多 100 条；只等响应 |","table":"table-4"},"609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                  | 语义                                                                      |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `react` / `unreact` | **自动挑方法**：bot 只能 `setMessageReactions`，用户号用 `add/removeMessageReaction` |","table":"table-4"},"610":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                               | 语义                   |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` | 显式走某一条路（省一次 `getMe`） |","table":"table-4"},"611":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                        | 语义  |\n| ------------------------- | --- |\n| `me` / `my_id` / `is_bot` | 身份  |","table":"table-4"},"612":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                                                  | 语义                                                                    |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `chat_member` / `is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` | 管理权（`right` 是 `chatAdministratorRights` 的字段名，如 `can_delete_messages`） |","table":"table-4"},"613":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op              | 语义                                 |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` | 等到 `updateFile` 报下载完成，返回最终的 `file` |","table":"table-4"},"614":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op       | 语义                                                |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke` | 逃生舱：`args.request` 是**完整**的 TDLib 请求 JSON，发 + 等响应 |","table":"table-4"},"615":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"操作表可以问出来：`{\"op\":\"list_ops\"}`。"},"616":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"Rust 的 `extern \"C\" fn(.., ...)` 确实稳定（能写、cbindgen 也能生成），但**本 ABI 一个都没用**，\n理由只有一条：`...` 会把**参数类型和个数校验全部丢掉**。VTable 里 22 个函数的参数都是固定的，\n用 `...` 只会让 C 侧传错参数从编译错误降级成运行期 UB。"},"617":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"将来真要加，正确的声明形状是（C 侧）："},"618":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"两条必须知道的事："},"619":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"变参部分**不能**是唯一的参数——C 要求 `...` 之前至少有一个具名参数。"},"620":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"**变参函数指针跨不了 ABI 的 `Option` 优化**：`Option<fn(..., ...)>` 不是 niche 优化，占**两个指针宽**，\n必须显式判空。本 crate 里那条\n`size_of::<Option<unsafe extern \"C\" fn()>>() == size_of::<*const c_void>()` 断言只对**非变参**函数指针\n成立；普通函数指针字段能享受 niche 优化（`NULL` 就是 `None`），这也是「整个 VTable 所有字段都能是\n`Option<...>` 且不撑大布局」的前提之一。"},"621":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                                              | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| C   | 头文件 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 5` | 5   | 模板里写 `if (host == NULL \\|\\| host->version != ABI_VERSION) return failed;` |","table":"table-5"},"622":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                   | 值   | 怎么生效                   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| C++ | 同一份 `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 5   | 同上（导出符号放 `extern \"C\"`） |","table":"table-5"},"623":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言   | 声明在哪                                                                                   | 值   | 怎么生效                                              |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `fuyubot_plugin_api::SDK_ABI_VERSION`、`COMPATIBLE_HOST_ABI_VERSIONS`、`is_compatible()` | 5   | `define_plugin!` 把它填进 `PluginHandle::abi_version` |","table":"table-5"},"624":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言     | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                                                              |\n| ------ | ------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Python | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 由中间插件 `fuyubot_python_host` 承载（标准 ABI v5 cdylib），`abi_version` 它填 |","table":"table-5"},"625":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言      | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                      |\n| ------- | ------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 同上，由 `fuyubot_js_host` 承载 |","table":"table-5"},"626":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"⚠️ **过渡期**：宿主已经是 v5 了，而 SDK 仓库里手工构造 `HostApiVTable` 的三处\n（`fuyubot-plugin-api` / `fuyubot-sdk-host` / `fuyubot-sdk-script`）还停在 v4。\n按上面的协商规则，**v4 插件会被 v5 宿主拒绝加载**（`AbiMismatch`）——SDK 跟着发一版之前，\n各语言插件需要重新编译 / 更新 SDK。"},"627":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"脚本插件走的是薄 SDK（`fuyubot.py` / `fuyubot.ts`）→ 原生桥 → 中间插件这条路，\n**作者永远不碰 C ABI**；ABI 版本由承载它的那份 cdylib 声明。Python 与 JS 的中间插件\n是同一套机制的两份实现，「两门语言对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"628":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`EventCallbackFn` 与 `MiddlewareCallbackFn` 都是 `unsafe extern \"C-unwind\" fn(...)`。\n`extern \"C\"` 边界上逃出去的 panic 会直接 **abort 整个进程**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`；\n`C-unwind` 允许 unwind 穿过边界，宿主就能接住、记一条日志、继续跑下一条更新。\n对 C/C++ 而言两者 ABI 完全一致；C++ 异常同样会穿过这个边界，**请自己在回调内处理完**。"},"629":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`define_plugin!` 生成的三个导出函数还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——两层都要。"},"630":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不会**调 `plugin_stop`：那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。字段只增不改，\n新增一律追加在尾部；改动必须同时抬 `ABI_VERSION`。"},"631":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"page","content":"异步等待（await）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async"},"632":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"Rust / JS / TS / Python 里可 await 的请求与更新等待"},"633":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"Rust：`ResponseRouter`"},"634":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"JS / TS：`invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`"},"635":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"Python：`run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async`"},"636":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"托管路径：`fuyubot.py`"},"637":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"托管路径：`fuyubot.js`"},"638":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"选哪个"},"639":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具结果"},"640":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"`wait_for_update` 是**阻塞**原语：调用线程停下来等。要 JS `async/await` 那种语义，\n用下面这层**不阻塞**的封装——任务挂起，事件到了再唤醒。"},"641":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"> ⚠️ 这里有两套脚本 SDK，先确认你在哪一套：\n>\n> | 路径 | 入口 | 本文的 await |\n> | --- | --- | --- |\n> | `script_plugin!` 内嵌脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-script`） | `fuyubot_plugin.py` / `fuyubot_plugin.js` | ✅ 有 |\n> | `fuyubot-python-host` 托管脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-native`） | `fuyubot.py` | ✅ 有（`run_async`） |\n> | `fuyubot-js-host` 托管脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-native`） | `fuyubot.js` | ✅ 有（`runAsync`） |\n>\n> 选错文件会出现「方法不存在」——先看插件目录里拷的是哪一个。"},"642":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`fuyubot-plugin-api` 从 ABI v4 起重导出 `ResponseRouter` / `ResponseFuture` / `UpdateFuture`："},"643":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"要点："},"644":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"**必须在插件自己的 executor 上 await**，别在宿主事件回调里 await（那是接收线程）。"},"645":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`router.invoke*` 从插件自己的线程发请求时会用 scope service 把归属切回插件，\n响应不会丢；不需要手动 `scope_enter`。"},"646":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"取消 = `drop(fut)`；关闭 = drop router（所有 pending 立刻 `RouterClosed`）。"},"647":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"超时不内建，用 `tokio::time::timeout` 或你运行时的等价物。"},"648":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.js`（`script_plugin!` 内嵌路径）在回调协议上包了 Promise："},"649":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"TDLib 业务错误（`@type: \"error\"`）也 **resolve**；只有宿主拒绝请求才 reject。"},"650":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"`waitAsync` 超时/取消返回 `null`。"},"651":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"老的 `invoke(..., onResponse)` / `waitForUpdate(..., onMatch)` 是底层/兼容 API。"},"652":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.py`（`script_plugin!` 内嵌路径）提供 asyncio 版，**不改老的 `run()`**："},"653":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`run_async` 建 asyncio 事件循环，后台线程读 stdin；`main` 在 `ready` 之后作为任务启动。"},"654":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`invoke_async` 的业务错误也 resolve，宿主拒绝请求才抛异常。"},"655":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`wait_async` 超时/取消返回 `None`。"},"656":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"**仍然可以用 `run()`**：同步循环、没有事件循环，`invoke_async` 会直接报错。"},"657":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`fuyubot-python-host` 用 `uv run` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.py`（ctypes 原生桥），\nAPI 名字一样，只是 `import` 不同："},"658":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`run_async` 把原生桥的阻塞 `run()` 放到后台线程，主线程跑 asyncio 循环。"},"659":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`invoke_async` 的回调从原生桥线程 `call_soon_threadsafe` 回事件循环。"},"660":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`wait_async` 是**一次性** `on(\"update\", ...)` 订阅，命中/超时后自动退订；\n`timeout_ms=0` 表示一直等。"},"661":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., on_response)` 原样保留。"},"662":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`fuyubot-js-host` 用 `bun` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.ts` / `fuyubot.js`："},"663":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`runAsync` 把原生桥的 stdin 读取放后台线程，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调用）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑。"},"664":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`invokeAsync` 仍走 `invoke` 的 request/response 配对；`waitAsync` 是一次性\n`on(\"update\", ...)`，超时/命中后自动退订。"},"665":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., onResponse)` 原样保留。"},"666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                  | 用什么                   |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 同步代码 / 宿主内部 / 登录状态机 | `wait_for_update`（阻塞） |","table":"table-0"},"667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                         | 用什么             