update","content":"具体 @type 通道"},"705":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"updateNewMessage、……"},"706":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"兜底 update 通道"},"707":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新都发一份"},"708":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 A"},"709":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"精确订阅 updateNewMessage"},"710":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 B"},"711":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"订阅兜底 update，或带过滤器"},"712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"**两条通道是「同时」，不是「二选一」**：一条 `updateNewMessage` 既会敲精确订阅它的监听器，也会敲所有\n订阅了 `\"update\"` 的监听器。过滤器在两个通道上各判一次，所以订阅兜底又写了过滤器的那一侧不会因为\n「没命中精确通道」而漏掉。"},"713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄必须活着。Rust 侧 `HostExt::subscribe_json` 返回的是 `#[must_use]` 的\n`Subscription`，**drop 就是退订**；`let _ = …` 会立刻退订。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，\n但那已经是另一回事了。"},"724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；`payload` 是宿主临时的\nNUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`parse_payload` 已经替你解析成 `serde_json::Value`）。"},"725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"脚本侧的订阅**没有退订接口**——注册后一直有效，随插件停止一起撤。\n方法的逐个说明见 Python 插件 / JS 与 TS 插件。"},"726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调：在 `plugin.c` 里加桥"},"731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到七个导出符号\n就认它。完整可跑的示例在 `examples/go-ping`。"},"737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"目前**没有** `fuyubot-sdk init --lang go` 模板——Go 这条路线是「自己搭工程」：\n抄 `examples/go-ping`，或者照下面这两段写。C 头文件仍然用\n`fuyubot-sdk codegen --lang c --dir <工程目录>` 生成，不要手抄。"},"738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（`codegen --lang c` 落的），**不提交** |","table":"table-0"},"741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"`examples/go-ping` 只带了两个桥（`fy_log` / `fy_invoke`）。要用别的 ABI 函数就照同样形状加——\n**每个桥一行转发**，Go 侧不碰函数指针："},"745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"Go 侧声明 + 包一层："},"746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"三条 cgo 侧的硬规则："},"747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"传给 C 的字符串用 `C.CString` + `defer C.free`；漏了就是泄漏。"},"748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"桥返回的 `const char *` 是**宿主缓冲**：`C.GoString` 立刻拷贝，**不要**把 `*C.char` 存下来，\n也**不要** free 它。"},"749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"订阅句柄留在 C 侧（`plugin_start` 里 `g_host->on(...)` 存进静态变量），Go 侧不持有——\ndrop 即退订，交到 Go 手里容易漏。"},"750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ⚠️ 本语言的 SDK 薄封装还没跟上（SDK 仓库待更新）；在那之前可以直接调 VTable 上那两个函数，\n> 或者照下面手写。"},"751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                               |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText` |","table":"table-1"},"752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | 先 `fy_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就查：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（2 个 u32 + `host_ctx` + 19 个函数指针、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"767":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"768":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"原生插件（一个 cdylib）与脚本插件（一个目录），以及四种导出符号"},"769":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"原生插件：七个导出符号"},"770":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"771":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的六件事"},"772":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"声明依赖：`inject` 与 `soft_inject`"},"773":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"774":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"775":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"776":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**插件有两种形态**，按需求选："},"777":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件           | 脚本插件             |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------- |\n| 语言  | Rust / C / C++ | Python / JS / TS |","table":"table-0"},"778":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                 | 脚本插件                        |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| 形态  | 一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`） | 一个目录（manifest + 脚本 + 薄 SDK） |","table":"table-0"},"779":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件              | 脚本插件         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI 函数调用 | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"780":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件 | 脚本插件          |\n| --- | ---- | ------------- |\n| 崩溃  | 拖垮宿主 | 只有子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"781":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|      | 原生插件        | 脚本插件    |\n| ---- | ----------- | ------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要（用你自己的工具链） | 不要，装上就跑 |","table":"table-0"},"782":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                | 脚本插件   |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- | ------ |\n| 起步  | `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` | 看 脚本插件 |","table":"table-0"},"783":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** 看 脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，`fuyubot plugin install` 装上就跑。"},"784":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认这七个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"785":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"786":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-1"},"787":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-1"},"788":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-1"},"789":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读它来决定激活顺序 |","table":"table-1"},"790":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 干什么                                          |\n| --------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`，`fuyubot-sdk check` 靠它 |","table":"table-1"},"791":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | 只在 ABI 版本不匹配时被调——那一刻不能调 `plugin_stop`，只能用它把 `init` 分配的状态还回来 |","table":"table-1"},"792":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商、服务作用域）见 ABI 契约。"},"793":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"794":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"795":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 按 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}` 找产物（两边都有时取较新的）。插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，\n`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，靠最后一档照样能找到，不需要额外参数。"},"796":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**SDK 走源码开发时**设 `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 FuyuBot-SDK 仓库的 `crates/`，生成的插件会写 `path = \"…\"`；\n不设就写 crates.io 版本号。"},"797":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 管运行，`fuyubot-sdk` 管开发，**两个都不编译插件**：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"798":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-2"},"799":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 七个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-2"},"800":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `4` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，不能调 `plugin_stop`，但会调 `plugin_free_handle` 把状态还回来 |","table":"table-2"},"801":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 订阅句柄必须活着 | Rust 侧是 `#[must_use]` 的守卫，drop 就是退订 |","table":"table-2"},"802":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-2"},"803":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-2"},"804":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"manifest 里能声明两个列表，它们决定**宿主什么时候让你跑**、以及**跑的顺序**："},"805":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段       | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                            |\n| -------- | --- | -------------------------------- |\n| `inject` | 硬依赖 | **不激活**。停在 `Pending` 等着，等你缺的东西出现 |","table":"table-3"},"806":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段            | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                  |\n| ------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `soft_inject` | 软依赖 | 照常激活，只是排在「软依赖也齐了」的插件后面 |","table":"table-3"},"807":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"依赖名可以写两种东西，宿主都认："},"808":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**服务名** —— 比如 `\"storage.mongo\"`，宿主查 `Context` 里有没有这个名字"},"809":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**插件名** —— 比如 `\"fuyubot.manage\"`，宿主查同名插件是不是 `Active`"},"810":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"硬依赖决定能不能跑，软依赖只决定排队位置"},"811":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject 里的名字不齐就不激活，停在 Pending 等着；soft_inject 只影响排序，不齐也照常激活。名字可以是服务名，也可以是插件名。"},"812":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject（硬）"},"813":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;storage.mongo&quot;]"},"814":{"id":"/docs/plugin-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不齐就不激活"},"815":{"id":"/docs/plugin-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"soft_inject（软）"},"816":{"id":"/docs/plugin-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;cache.redis&quot;]"},"817":{"id":"/docs/plugin-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"只影响排队位置"},"818":{"id":"/docs/plugin-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"宿主检查：这个名字在不在？"},"819":{"id":"/docs/plugin-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"服务名或插件名都认"},"820":{"id":"/docs/plugin-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不在"},"821":{"id":"/docs/plugin-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"在"},"822":{"id":"/docs/plugin-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"Pending"},"823":{"id":"/docs/plugin-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"等着——不是失败"},"824":{"id":"/docs/plugin-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"激活"},"825":{"id":"/docs/plugin-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排在有软依赖的后面"},"826":{"id":"/docs/plugin-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"三件事值得先记住："},"827":{"id":"/docs/plugin-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**`Pending` 不是失败。** 它表示「还没轮到」或「等的东西还没来」。真正的失败只有两种：\n你的 `plugin_start` 报错，或者你依赖的**提供者已经 `Failed`**（那时你也会被级联标成 `Failed`）。"},"828":{"id":"/docs/plugin-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**软依赖不保证顺序。** 它只是排序偏好：软依赖齐的先上，不齐的也照样上，只是排后面。\n要「他必须先于我」就写 `inject`，别用 `soft_inject`。"},"829":{"id":"/docs/plugin-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**依赖是准入，不是注入。** 宿主不会把那个服务的引用塞给你——你仍然自己去 `get_service`\n拿。`inject` 只保证「轮到我的时候它一定在」。"},"830":{"id":"/docs/plugin-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排查看 `fuyubot status`：`pending` 那一栏会列出插件名**和它还缺哪些**。"},"831":{"id":"/docs/plugin-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"832":{"id":"/docs/plugin-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"833":{"id":"/docs/plugin-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"834":{"id":"/docs/plugin-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"835":{"id":"/docs/plugin-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"836":{"id":"/docs/plugin-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"837":{"id":"/docs/plugin-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"838":{"id":"/docs/plugin-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"839":{"id":"/docs/plugin-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"840":{"id":"/docs/plugin-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"841":{"id":"/docs/plugin-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"842":{"id":"/docs/plugin-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"843":{"id":"/docs/plugin-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名只有 dlopen 之后才知道**：它来自 `plugin_init` 返回的 `PluginHandle`，所以\n`fuyubot plugin list` 会真的加载一次再看名字。"},"844":{"id":"/docs/plugin-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**脚本插件的身份在 manifest 里**（Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]` / JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n目录名是装卸载的单位（`fuyubot plugin install|uninstall <目录>`），见 脚本插件。"},"845":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts"},"846":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"847":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"848":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"849":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"850":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"851":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"852":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"853":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"854":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"855":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"`registerTool` — 登记工具"},"856":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`useMiddleware` — 挂中间件"},"857":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"858":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"859":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"发消息：手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"860":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"861":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 插件就是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，入口文件写逻辑，`fuyubot.ts`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。运行时是 bun，**TS 不需要 `tsc`**。上手三步见\n脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"862":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"本页讲托管路径的 `fuyubot.js` / `fuyubot.ts`（`fuyubot-js-host`），它也支持\n`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`。`script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.js` 有同名 API，见 异步等待。"},"863":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `index.ts`）："},"864":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"薄 SDK 把 VTable 那 20 个函数包成了这些（`run()` 之前只能调同步的那几个）："},"865":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 走的 ABI | 干什么             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | `on`   | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"866":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI | 干什么    |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------ |\n| `off(event, handler)` | `off`  | 退订一个订阅 |","table":"table-0"},"867":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 调一次 TDLib 接口；给了 `onResponse` 就在响应回来时调（按 `request_id` 配对，不用自己记请求号） |","table":"table-0"},"868":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么           |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| `invokeAsync(method, params?)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 同上，返回 Promise |","table":"table-0"},"869":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | `emit` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收到） |","table":"table-0"},"870":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                      |\n| ------------------------------ | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level = \"info\")` | `log`  | 打日志（`debug` / `info` / `warn` / `error`） |","table":"table-0"},"871":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                   | 走的 ABI                    | 干什么                            |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `registerTool(name, description = \"\", inputSchema?)` | `register_tool`（`meta` 版） | 登记工具**元数据**——脚本不能交函数指针，所以没有处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"872":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI             | 干什么                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `callTool(name, input?, onResponse?)` | `call_tool_result` | 调用一个工具，**同步**拿输出（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"873":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么          |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `listTools(onTools?)` | `list_tools` | 同步列出全部工具的元数据 |","table":"table-0"},"874":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `tdExecute(request, onResult?)` | `td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的 TDLib 方法（`parseTextEntities` 之类），发消息**不能**走它 |","table":"table-0"},"875":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI           | 干什么                                  |\n| ------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | `use_middleware` | 挂中间件（`stage` 是 0..5）；不能单独注销，随插件停止一起撤 |","table":"table-0"},"876":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `waitForUpdate(filter, timeoutMs?, onMatch?)` | `wait_for_update` | 等一条匹配的更新（在宿主侧独立线程里等），超时回调收到 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"877":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI            | 干什么            |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------- |\n| `waitAsync(filter, timeoutMs?)` | `wait_for_update` | 上一条的 Promise 版 |","table":"table-0"},"878":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI        | 干什么                       |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `getService(name, onService?)` | `get_service` | 读一个服务的元数据；不存在时回调收到 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"879":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                             | 走的 ABI        | 干什么         |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| `callService(name, method, input?, onResult?)` | `get_service` | 同步调用服务的某个方法 |","table":"table-0"},"880":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法         | 走的 ABI | 干什么                          |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `config()` | —      | `plugin_start` 传进来的那份配置 JSON |","table":"table-0"},"881":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法               | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                |\n| ---------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pluginConfig()` | —      | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"882":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                           |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `getConfig(section, key?, onConfig?)` | `get_config` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"883":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `setConfig(key, value, onDone?)` | `set_config` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"884":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | —      | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"885":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"三条容易踩的："},"886":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`onResponse` / `onResult` 这类回调**只在 `run()` 之后才有**——宿主得先握手；模块顶层只能调\n`pluginConfig()` 这种同步的。"},"887":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`tdExecute` 只给不碰网络的方法用，拿它发消息会失败。"},"888":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`waitForUpdate` 是在**宿主侧**线程里等的，脚本这边不阻塞；`timeoutMs` 省略表示只检查当前状态。"},"889":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `pluginConfig()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"890":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`getConfig`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `null`。"},"891":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`setConfig`）也是异步的，成功后 `onDone(true)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"892":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `onDone`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"893":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`setConfig` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"894":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"895":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"896":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"897":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么到你手上"},"898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 的更新按 @type 分发到具体订阅，没有具体订阅时落到 update 兜底通道；插件自己 emit 的事件直接送给对应订阅者。"},"899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 更新"},"900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"按 @type 分发"},"901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"PreRoute 之后"},"902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;updateNewMessage&apos;)"},"903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"具体类型"},"904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;update&apos;)"},"905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"兜底通道"},"906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"emit(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"自己 emit 的事件不走 @type 分发，直接送到同名订阅者——所以插件之间的通信不必绕 TDLib。"},"909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的对象，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{ \"点分路径\": 期望值 }`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `onResponse` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"**`_` 就是 `\"@type\"`**：`params` 里嵌的 TDLib 对象都可以把判别字段写成 `_`，\n薄 SDK 会在发往宿主之前**递归**换回 `\"@type\"`——嵌套多深、数组里的对象都算。\n两种写法等价，同时写了两个时以 `\"@type\"` 为准："},"916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"这一层只在 JS / TS 薄 SDK 里做（宿主不会替你补判别字段），而且只作用于要发给\nTDLib 的东西：`emit` 的自定义负载、`callTool` 的参数不过这一步，那里的 `_`\n就是个普通字段。"},"917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `onResponse` 被调用。\n不传 `onResponse` 就是「发完不管」。"},"918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"923":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"924":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"925":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**按聊天计数**——记住状态："},"926":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ⚠️ 本语言的 SDK 薄封装还没跟上（SDK 仓库待更新）；在那之前可以直接调 VTable 上那两个函数，\n> 或者照下面手写。"},"927":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                       |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，里面 `text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-2"},"928":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                                                        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `tdExecute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2，`textParseModeHTML` = HTML），把返回的 `formattedText` 整个塞进去 |","table":"table-2"},"929":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-2"},"930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                               |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}`（论坛）；非论坛的评论串才是 `messageTopicThread` |","table":"table-2"},"931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；⚠️ callback 按钮的 `data` 是 **base64**（TDLib 里它是 `bytes`） |","table":"table-2"},"932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 都在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层字段 |","table":"table-2"},"933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                                    |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | `onResponse` 只到**临时消息**；要最终那条 `Message` 得再等一条 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-2"},"934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就问 SDK，它读的是真 `td_api.tl`：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun fuyubot.ts` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 bun（机器人用 `bun install` 装依赖、`bun` 起脚本）。"},"938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：JS 侧没有 schema，先判空或 `as any` 再取；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"七个符号"},"942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调（C / C++ 同一套）"},"945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 Rust 定义生成，\n用 `fuyubot-sdk codegen` 落盘，别手改（改了下次就被覆盖）。"},"950":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。可 await 的版本只在 Rust / JS / TS / Python 的脚本 SDK 里，\n见 异步等待。"},"951":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"v3 是四件套，v4 又加了三个（都可以不写，但写了才有对应能力）。"},"952":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"953":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"954":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"955":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放本插件 `malloc` 出来的字符串（`plugin_manifest` 返回的那块也走它） |","table":"table-0"},"956":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 说明                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`），宿主在 `init` 之前读 |","table":"table-0"},"957":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 说明                                            |\n| --------------------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回 `ABI_VERSION`，`fuyubot-sdk check` 用它判断版本 |","table":"table-0"},"958":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | ABI 版本不匹配时宿主靠它回收 `init` 分配的状态（那时不能调 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-0"},"959":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"960":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"961":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是七个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"962":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"963":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"每个函数第一个参数都是 `g_host->host_ctx`。下面把常用的走了一遍："},"964":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"⚠️ 三条所有权规则（跨界最容易出事的地方）："},"965":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`td_execute` / `get_config` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` / `list_plugins` 返回的\n`const char *` 是**宿主线程局部缓冲**，下一次宿主调用之前有效——要留就当场 `strdup`，\n**不要 free 它**。"},"966":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"反过来，只有 `plugin_manifest` 返回的那块是**你自己 malloc 的**，宿主读完用\n`plugin_free_string` 还给你（所以必须真能 free，别返回静态字符串）。"},"967":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`on` 的 `filter_json` 里 `event_type` 键只用来**选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"968":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"969":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"970":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上那两个函数："},"971":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，所以插件无法伪造写别人的段。"},"972":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ⚠️ 本语言的 SDK 薄封装还没跟上（SDK 仓库待更新）；在那之前可以直接调 VTable 上那两个函数，\n> 或者照下面手写。"},"973":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-1"},"974":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 原样塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"975":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"976":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"977":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"978":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"979":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"980":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"要 Markdown 就分两步：先 `td_execute` 拿 `parseTextEntities` 的结果（一个 `formattedText`），\n把它的 `text` 与 `entities` 拼进上面的 `input_message_content`。方法名拿不准时用\n`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage` 查真签名。"},"981":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"982":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"983":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`，手写注释会丢（见上面「读 / 写配置」）。"},"984":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"985":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python"},"986":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"987":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"988":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"989":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"990":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"991":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"992":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"993":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"994":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"995":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"`register_tool` — 登记工具"},"996":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`use_middleware` — 挂中间件"},"997":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"998":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"999":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"发消息：手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"Python 插件就是一个目录：`pyproject.toml` 写身份，`main.py` 写逻辑，`fuyubot.py`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。上手三步见 脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"本页的 `fuyubot.py`（`fuyubot-python-host`）和 `script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` 都支持 `run_async` / `invoke_async` / `wait_async`，\n见 异步等待。"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"1004":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"薄 SDK 把 VTable 那 20 个函数包成了这些（`run()` 之前只能调同步的那几个）："},"1005":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 走的 ABI | 干什么             |\n| --------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter=None)` | `on`   | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI | 干什么                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------ |\n| `off(event, handler)` | `off`  | 退订一个订阅（脚本订阅也能按事件 + 处理器退） |","table":"table-0"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                                                |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 调一次 TDLib 接口；给了 `on_response` 就在响应回来时回调（按 `request_id` 配对，你不用记请求号） |","table":"table-0"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                  | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                              |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `invoke_async(method, params=None)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 同上，但返回可 `await` 的 future（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI | 干什么                    |\n| --------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | `emit` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收到） |","table":"table-0"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                      |\n| ---------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | `log`  | 打日志（`debug` / `info` / `warn` / `error`） |","table":"table-0"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 走的 ABI                    | 干什么                            |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | `register_tool`（`meta` 版） | 登记工具**元数据**——脚本不能交函数指针，所以没有处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 走的 ABI             | 干什么                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `call_tool(name, input=None, on_response=None)` | `call_tool_result` | 调用一个工具，**同步**拿输出（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI       | 干什么          |\n| --------------------------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `list_tools(on_tools=None)` | `list_tools` | 同步列出全部工具的元数据 |","table":"table-0"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute(request, on_result=None)` | `td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的 TDLib 方法（`parseTextEntities` 之类），发消息**不能**走它 |","table":"table-0"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 走的 ABI           | 干什么                                  |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | `use_middleware` | 挂中间件（`stage` 是 0..5）；无法单独注销，随插件停止一起撤 |","table":"table-0"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                     | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, timeout_ms=0, on_match=None)` | `wait_for_update` | 阻塞等一条匹配的更新（在宿主侧独立线程里等），超时 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                 | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `wait_async(filter, timeout_ms=0)` | `wait_for_update` | 上一条的 `await` 版（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                   | 走的 ABI        | 干什么                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `get_service(name, on_service=None)` | `get_service` | 读一个服务的元数据；不存在时回调收到 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 走的 ABI        | 干什么         |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| `call_service(name, method, input=None, on_result=None)` | `get_service` | 同步调用服务的某个方法 |","table":"table-0"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法         | 走的 ABI | 干什么                          |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `config()` | —      | `plugin_start` 传进来的那份配置 JSON |","table":"table-0"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                |\n| ----------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_config()` | —      | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                           |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key=\"\", on_config=None)` | `get_config` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value, on_done=None)` | `set_config` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | —      | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run_async(main=None)` | —      | 同上，但跑 asyncio 事件循环，`invoke_async` / `wait_async` 要用它 |","table":"table-0"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"三条容易踩的："},"1027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`on_response` / `on_result` 这类回调**只在 `run()` 之后才有**——宿主得先握手；模块顶层只能调\n`plugin_config()` 这种同步的。"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`td_execute` 只给不碰网络的方法用，拿它发消息会失败。"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`wait_for_update` 是在**宿主侧**线程里等的，脚本这边不阻塞；`timeout_ms=0` 表示只检查当前状态。"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `plugin_config()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"1031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`get_config`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `None`。"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`set_config`）也是异步的，成功后 `on_done(True)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `on_done`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`set_config` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"1036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么到你手上"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 的更新按 @type 分发到具体订阅，没有具体订阅时落到 update 兜底通道；插件自己 emit 的事件直接送给对应订阅者。"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 更新"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"按 @type 分发"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"PreRoute 之后"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;updateNewMessage&apos;)"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"具体类型"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;update&apos;)"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"兜底通道"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"emit(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"自己 emit 的事件不走 @type 分发，直接送到同名订阅者——所以插件之间的通信不必绕 TDLib。"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的 `dict`，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**是两参数函数，不是装饰器**——`@on(...)` 会报错，老老实实 `on(事件, 函数)`。\n同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{\"点分路径\": 期望值}`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"1055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `on_response` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `on_response` 被调用。\n不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」。"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"1058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"1063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"1064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**看全部流量**——兜底通道记日志："},"1065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ⚠️ 本语言的 SDK 薄封装还没跟上（SDK 仓库待更新）；在那之前可以直接调 VTable 上那两个函数，\n> 或者照下面手写。"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                       |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，里面 `text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-2"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                                                         |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2，`textParseModeHTML` = HTML），把返回的 `formattedText` 整个塞进去 |","table":"table-2"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-2"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                               |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}`（论坛）；非论坛的评论串才是 `messageTopicThread` |","table":"table-2"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；⚠️ callback 按钮的 `data` 是 **base64**（TDLib 里它是 `bytes`） |","table":"table-2"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 都在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层字段 |","table":"table-2"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | `on_response` 只到**临时消息**；要最终那条 `Message` 得再等一条 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-2"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就问 SDK，它读的是真 `td_api.tl`：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python fuyubot.py` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 uv（机器人用 `uv sync` 装依赖、`uv run` 起脚本）。"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：先判空再取（`dict.get()`），不同更新类型的字段位置不一样；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage：三种构建方式，两个出口"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown、服务端 HTML、手拼块树三条路都能产出同一个 RichMessage 类型；它只有两个出口——发送和编辑，各自落到对应的 TDLib 方法。"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_markdown（本地转）"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown / HTML"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"server_markdown / server_html"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"块树"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_blocks（最底层）"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"三种方式产出同一个类型，下游只认它"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"send_rich_message"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"edit_rich_message"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"sendMessage"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"editMessageText"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"1104":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"1111":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"1114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"fuyubot-plugin-api 与 define_plugin! 的完整写法"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调里带状态"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#用封装层发消息fuyubot-simplify","content":"用封装层发消息：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-plugin-api`。它把 `fuyubot-abi` 的形状转成用着不疼的样子——\n`HostApi`（已解包、调用路径上没有 `Option` 和 panic 分支）、`HostExt` 便利方法、\ndrop 即退订的 `Subscription`、`ResponseRouter`（可 `await` 的请求/更新等待），以及\n`define_plugin!` 宏。异步写法见 异步等待。"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"这就是 `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` 生成的模板："},"1134":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 加载失败 |","table":"table-0"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 宿主已把 VTable、插件目录都准备好；订阅/注册都写在这里 |","table":"table-0"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选；宏随后把状态收回 `Box` 释放 |","table":"table-0"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和 `C-unwind` 是两层，\n**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（详见配置文件）。\n`HostApi` 上两个方法直接读写它："},"1139":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读**任意**段。`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` 等），`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段。成功后写内存并回写 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`——你手写在文件里的注释、空行会被 `toml`\n序列化丢掉。插件写配置属于程序化修改，这是可接受的取舍；要保注释就别让插件运行时去改，\n把值手工维护进文件。"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去，要么像\n`examples/rust-echo` 那样把 `Box<HostApi>` 的地址当 `user_data`："},"1143":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`stop` 里用 `Box::from_raw` 收回，只收一次；否则就是内存泄漏（或重复释放）。"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`：`let _ = host.subscribe_json(…)` 会**立刻退订**。\n一定要存进插件字段。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，但那时插件自己的状态已经漏了。"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`HostApi` 上是 VTable 那 20 个函数的一对一封装，`HostExt` 另外给了几个「不用自己拼 JSON 字符串」\n的便利方法（`subscribe_json` / `invoke_value` / `call_tool_value` / `config_value` /\n`set_config_value` / `wait_for_update_json` / `info|warn|error`）。下面这段把它们用了一遍\n（省掉了 `user_data` 取 `HostApi` 的样板，见上面「回调里带状态」一节）："},"1146":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么    | 用哪个                                                    |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 订阅 / 退订 | `subscribe_json`（返回 `Subscription`，drop 即退订）/ 句柄 `off` |","table":"table-2"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么       | 用哪个                                                             |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发 TDLib 请求 | `invoke_value(method, params)`（或底层 `td_invoke_simplified` 吃字符串） |","table":"table-2"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个      