in install <目录>` | 目录整个拷进 `plugins/scripts/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-1"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应          |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内自动发现、装依赖、启动 |","table":"table-1"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应              |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 自动停掉对应脚本（对跑着的实例也安全） |","table":"table-1"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-1"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并卸载脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**名字的两副面孔**：manifest 里的 `name`（如 `mybot.my-plugin`）是插件身份，日志里看到的是它；\n`plugin uninstall` 用的是**目录名**（`my-plugin`）。装的时候整个目录一起拷，\n`node_modules` / `.venv` / `target` 这类依赖与构建产物会被跳过——到机器人上现装。"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）            | 原生插件                   |\n| --- | ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 写什么 | Python / JS / TS 脚本 | Rust / C / C++ 编译出的动态库 |","table":"table-2"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|      | 脚本插件（本页） | 原生插件        |\n| ---- | -------- | ----------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 不要       | 要（用你自己的工具链） |","table":"table-2"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|       | 脚本插件（本页）          | 原生插件     |\n| ----- | ----------------- | -------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 只有这个脚本的进程死，机器人照常跑 | 可能拖垮整个宿主 |","table":"table-2"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）      | 原生插件         |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| 适合  | 机器人逻辑、自动化、小工具 | 高性能、要贴近宿主的场合 |","table":"table-2"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"原生插件是「一个 cdylib 一个插件」，见 插件总览。"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**脚本报「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：脚本进程要加载 `fuyubot_sdk_native`\n（和托管插件是同一份库）。把它放在插件目录里，或设环境变量\n`FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指向它的完整路径，再重启机器人。"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：Python 要装 uv，JS / TS 要装\nbun。缺了的话对应脚本起不来，日志里会有提示，但不影响机器人启动。"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**托管插件**：`plugins/` 里要有 `fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`\n两个中间插件（脚本由它们托管），和内置插件放在一起。"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**插件名只允许**字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`。"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**想排查脚本**：把配置里 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见\n配置文件），日志会详细很多。"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"page","content":"Simplify 封装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"fuyubot-simplify 的 API 参考：按功能范围分组的参数结构体、链式设置器与返回值"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"别的语言怎么用同一套语义"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"1. 文本内容：`Text` 与 `ParseMode`"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"2. 发送：`SendMessageParams`"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"话题：`Topic`"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"3. 媒体：`Media` / `InputFile` / `Thumbnail`"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"4. 相册：`SendAlbumParams`"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"5. 编辑、删除与应答"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"6. 内联键盘：`ReplyButton`"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"7. 命令与输入"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"8. 等待与订阅"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"9. 实体与下载"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#10-富消息","content":"10. 富消息"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"11. 管理权：`AdminRight`"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"12. 转发：`ForwardParams`"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"13. 表情反应：`Reaction`"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"14. 连接状态：`ConnectionTracker`"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"15. 不挂在 `Simplify` 上的公开函数"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"16. 参数名为什么是这几个"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"17. 异步版：`*_then`"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"18. 返回值与错误"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"19. 简化事件"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 只做一件事：**把 TDLib 的输入拼好、把结果等回来**，返回值仍然是 TDLib 的原始 JSON\n（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`）。"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"三条贯穿全部方法的约定："},"1255":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号；唯一的例外是 `formatted`（同步调用，压根没有等待）。"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**等待的方法是阻塞的**。插件的更新回调就跑在 TDLib 接收循环那个线程上，在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。回调里一律用 `*_then`（见第 13 节）。"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"失败一律是 `Err(SimplifyError)`，成功时的返回值见第 14 节。"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"本文按**功能范围**分组；想知道这些方法内部怎么实现（为什么这么拼、为什么这么等），\n看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"**ABI v5 起这套语义不再只有 Rust 有。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑**同一份** `fuyubot-simplify` 代码\n（`fuyubot-simplify::ops`），经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张 **op 表**："},"1260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"所以 Go / C / C++ / JS / TS / Python 插件都能用「发消息等结局、超时撤回、bot 与用户号挑不同反应\n方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树」，行为与 Rust 侧**逐字一致**——没有第二套实现。\n完整清单与结果形状见 ABI › simplify 操作表。"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"Rust 插件**仍然用本页这些类型化方法**：它们有编译期检查与链式设置器，比拼 JSON 舒服。\n`ops` 那层是给「没有 Rust 类型系统可用」的调用方准备的。"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"除了发/改/删，这一层还收了四件「TDLib 里没有直觉上那个方法」的事：\n管理权 / 转发 /\n表情反应 / 连接状态。"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"带标记的文本**不由本 crate 解析**——经**同步**的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`\n（为什么不能用异步，见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的里的「文本链路」一节）。"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '原始文本（还没解析的那种）。', type: 'String', required: true, }, parse_mode: { descriptio…\" />"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"快捷构造：`Text::plain` / `Text::markdown` / `Text::markdown_v2` / `Text::html` / `Text::new(text, mode)`；\n`&str` / `String` 直接转成纯文本。"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Plain`（默认） | **不发请求**，直接 `formattedText { text, entities: [] }` |","table":"table-0"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `Markdown`  | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 1` |","table":"table-0"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode`  | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `MarkdownV2` | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 2` |","table":"table-0"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`    |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `Html`      | `textParseModeHTML` |","table":"table-0"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"⚠️ **注意：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，不是 `**x**`。**\n`**bold**` 会被吞成 `bold` 而且**不给** bold entity，`__x__` 出来的是下划线。别按 CommonMark 的直觉写\n——这正是「不自己实现解析」的理由。"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"拿到结果也没干活不符预期：**拿不到就退回纯文本**并打一条 `Warn` 日志（没接 TDLib、TDLib 报错都一样），\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该整条发不出去。"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"`simplify.send_message(chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Value>`（**最终**那条 `Message`）。"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '文本。只填它就是纯文本消息；和 media 一起填时它是那件媒体的标题。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None'…\" />"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"常用构造：`SendMessageParams::text(\"你好\")` / `SendMessageParams::media(photo)`，\n其余字段走 `..SendMessageParams::default()`。"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"`topic_id` 不是裸 id，是 TDLib 的 `MessageTopic`——**四个构造器各有各的 id 类型**，选错了 TDLib 就拒："},"1276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                 | 用在哪                  | 发出的 `topic_id`                                     |\n| ------------------ | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::forum(id)` | **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                  | 用在哪           | 发出的 `topic_id`                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Topic::thread(id)` | **非论坛**群组的评论串 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                           | 用在哪     | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                             |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::direct_messages(id)` | 频道的私信话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicDirectMessages\",\"direct_messages_chat_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                          | 用在哪   | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                      |\n| --------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::saved_messages(id)` | 收藏夹话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicSavedMessages\",\"saved_messages_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"⚠️ 刻意**没有** `From<i64>`：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种，\n隐式转任何一个都会在另一种群里静默发错。（这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，非论坛群以外全是错的。）"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"七个变体对应 TDLib 的七个 `inputMessage*` 构造器："},"1282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                       |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Media::photo(file)` | `inputMessagePhoto` | `caption` / `thumbnail` / `width` / `height` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-2"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Media::video(file)` | `inputMessageVideo` | 上面五个 + **`cover`** / **`start_timestamp`** / `duration` / `supports_streaming` |","table":"table-2"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text