--------------------- | ------------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_caption(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditCaptionParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                          | 参数结构体             | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_media(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditMediaParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                           | 参数结构体 | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_reply_markup(chat_id, msg, &rows, timeout_ms)` | —     | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                 | 参数结构体 | 返回值  |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----- | ---- |\n| `delete_message(chat_id, ids, revoke, timeout_ms)` | —     | `()` |","table":"table-4"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                              | 参数结构体 | 返回值  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ----- | ---- |\n| `answer_callback_query(query_id, text, show_alert, timeout_ms)` | —     | `()` |","table":"table-4"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'EditTextParams.text': { description: '新文本；None 就是「只改键盘」。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None',…\" />"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"`delete_message` 的 `revoke = true` 表示对所有人撤回；`answer_callback_query` 的 `text` 是 `None` 就发空串\n（`url` / `cache_time` 固定 `\"\"` / `0`）。点了内联按钮之后**必须**应答，否则客户端一直转圈。"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '按钮文案。', type: 'String', required: true }, action: { description: '点下去做什么：Cal…\" />"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"构造：`ReplyButton::callback(text, data)` / `url` / `user` / `web_app`，再 `.emoji(id)` / `.style(..)`。"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"`command_of(update)` 从一条 `updateNewMessage` 里认出命令（只认文本消息，**跳过自己发的**）；\n`on_command(host, handler)` 一次性订阅，`CommandSubscription` **drop 即退订**——把它存进插件状态。"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ chat_id: { description: '命令所在的会话。', type: 'i64' }, message_id: { description: '这条消息本身（回复 / 编辑直接用它）…\" />"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"发送类方法等的是**两件事**——响应只是第一截，箭头指的地方才是它真正返回的位置："},"1317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"发送类方法的两段时间线"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"send_message 先发请求；收到响应时拿到的是还没发出去的临时消息，再等到发送结局 updateMessageSendSucceeded 或 updateMessageSendFailed 才返回最终 Message；超时则先撤回那条没发出去的消息再返回 Timeout。"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"时间去向右"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"① 发出请求"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"td_invoke sendMessage"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"② 收到响应"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"临时消息，还没发出去"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"③ 收到结局"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"Succeeded / Failed"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"send_message 在这里返回"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"最终 Message"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"超时：先撤回那条没发出去的"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"deleteMessages(revoke) → Timeout"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号；其余方法（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`）\n只等到 ② 就返回了。想自己接原始 JSON，用下面的 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update`。"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'UpdateFilter::new(type)': { description: '按「消息包在 message 里」的更新类型过滤，例如 updateNewMessage。', type: '…\" />"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"三条提醒：等待靠**更新投递**；`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里的 `update_type` 是**通道选择**\n（`event_type` 键），不参与负载匹配——详见订阅与事件。"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'resolve_entities(ids, timeout_ms)': { description: '并发发 getChat / getUser，再逐个收齐 → EntitiesResolut…\" />"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"想看实时进度又不想阻塞，就去订阅原始的 `updateFile`——原始更新一直可见，不与简化事件冲突。"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#10-富消息","content":"一套独立的参数类型（`RichMessageParams`），是因为它跟「文本 + 媒体」的互斥规则完全不同\n（那边二选一，这边是块树）。API 见富消息，本文不重复。"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"TDLib 里 `user` **连 `is_bot` 都没有**（身份在 `user.type`），管理权也不在任何「用户信息」上——\n它只在 `getChatMember` 给的 `ChatMember.status` 里。"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'is_chat_admin(chat_id, user_id, right, timeout_ms)': { description: '这个用户在这个聊天里有没有管理权。right: None…\" />"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"判定规则（`is_admin_status`）："},"1339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)`       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `chatMemberStatusCreator`（群主） | `true`        | `true`——群主拥有一切（唯一例外见下） |","table":"table-5"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                  | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)`                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `chatMemberStatusAdministrator` | `true`        | `status.rights.<x>` 必须为 `true`，字段缺失按 `false` |","table":"table-5"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                                    | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)` |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| 其余四种（`member` / `restricted` / `left` / `banned`） | `false`       | `false`          |","table":"table-5"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"⚠️ 群主的**匿名**是 `status.is_anonymous`，不在 `rights` 里——所以 `Some(AdminRight::IsAnonymous)`\n对群主读的是前者。`AdminRight` 共 18 项，名字就是 `chatAdministratorRights` 的字段名\n（`can_manage_chat` / `can_delete_messages` / `can_pin_messages` / …），认不出的字段名\n`AdminRight::from_key` 返回 `None`。"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"拿不到成员信息（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊）一律 `false`：**不确定时说「没有」比说「有」安全**。"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"`simplify.forward_messages(chat_id, from_chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Vec<Value>>`。"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ message_ids: { description: '要转发的消息 id。**会排序去重**——TDLib 要求严格递增、最多 100 条。', type: 'Vec<i64>', requi…\" />"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"走的是 `forwardMessages`（一次一组，**不是** Bot API 的 `forwardMessage`）。返回的是**还没发完**的临时消息\n——这里只等**响应**，不等发送结局，最终消息照旧经 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` / `updateMessageSendFailed`\n回来。单项没转发成功时 TDLib 在对应位置放 `null`，所以数组长度与排序后的 `message_ids` 一致、\n但元素可能是 `Null`。"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"空列表 → `SimplifyError::EmptyForward`，超过 100 条 → `TooManyForward`，两者都在发请求**之前**挡掉。"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"bot 与用户号**不是同一个方法**，这一点没有「通用写法」可言："},"1349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                                                   | 用哪个 TDLib 方法                                                 | 语义    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- |\n| `react(chat_id, msg, &reaction, is_big, timeout_ms)` | **自动**：bot → `setMessageReactions`，用户 → `addMessageReaction` | 加一个反应 |","table":"table-6"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                                             | 用哪个 TDLib 方法                                                         | 语义   |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| `unreact(chat_id, msg, &reaction, timeout_ms)` | **自动**：bot → `setMessageReactions` 传空列表，用户 → `removeMessageReaction` | 去掉反应 |","table":"table-6"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                 | 用哪个 TDLib 方法            | 语义                  |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `add_reaction(..)` | 固定 `addMessageReaction` | 已知自己是用户号时省掉 `getMe` |","table":"table-6"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                  | 用哪个 TDLib 方法             | 语义                   |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `set_reactions(..)` | 固定 `setMessageReactions` | 已知自己是 bot 时；空切片 = 清空 |","table":"table-6"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"自动判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type.@type == \"userTypeBot\"`，也就是说 `react` / `unreact` 每次会多一次\n`getMe` 往返（它不碰服务器，TDLib 本地应答）。⚠️ bot 侧没有「删一个」的说法，只能整组覆盖——\n所以 **bot 的 `unreact` 会忽略 `reaction` 参数**，直接清空。"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"`Reaction::emoji(\"👍\")` → `reactionTypeEmoji`；`Reaction::custom_emoji(id)` → `reactionTypeCustomEmoji`。\n付费反应（`reactionTypePaid`）不在这套里。"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"TDLib **没有** `getConnectionState`——连接状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 的形式出现，\n所以「现在连上了吗」只能自己订阅并记住最新那条。"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'track_connection_state()': { description: '订阅并记住最新一条 updateConnectionState → ConnectionTracker（dr…\" />"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"两个坑："},"1358":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"**订阅之前推过的更新补不回来**（TDLib 的状态更新不重放），所以在插件 `start` 里尽早调；\n晚订阅只会漏掉开头的 `Connecting` / `Updating`。"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"这是**连接**状态（到 Telegram 的链路），**不是**授权状态（`updateAuthorizationState`，登录那一套）。\n两者独立：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"纯函数，随手支配——想绕过某些方法的等待语义、自己拼请求时尤其有用："},"1361":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                                                       | 作用                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_text_params` / `edit_caption_params` / `edit_media_params` / `edit_markup_params` | 组装参数（**不含 `@type`**，那是宿主补的） |","table":"table-7"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                        | 作用                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `chat_member_params(chat_id, user_id)` / `forward_params(chat_id, from_chat_id, &params)` | 管理权 / 转发的参数（含 `MessageTopic` 与 `MessageSender` 的嵌套形状） |","table":"table-7"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                    | 作用                           |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `reaction_params` / `set_reactions_params` / `remove_reaction_params` | 三种反应请求的参数（user 分支与 bot 分支分开） |","table":"table-7"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                | 作用                                 |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `is_admin_status(&status, right)` | 判一份 `ChatMemberStatus` 有没有管理权，不发请求 |","table":"table-7"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                             | 作用                         |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `content_json(&Media, render)` | 媒体 → `InputMessageContent` |","table":"table-7"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                          | 作用                                        |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `parse_text_request(&Text)` | `parseTextEntities` 的请求；`Plain` 返回 `None` |","table":"table-7"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                | 作用                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `formatted_from(&Text, Option<&Value>)` / `is_formatted_text(..)` | 响应 → `formattedText`；拿不到退回纯文本 |","table":"table-7"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plain_text(&Text)` | 纯文本 → `formattedText`（不花往返），也是默认渲染器 |","table":"table-7"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                 | 作用     |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `command_of(&Value)` / `on_command(host, handler)` | 见第 7 节 |","table":"table-7"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"真 `td_api.tl`：`sendMessage chat_id topic_id reply_to options reply_markup input_message_content`\n——**没有** `message_thread_id` / 顶层 `disable_notification` / 顶层 `caption`（那些是 Bot API 的名字）。\n短名字到 TDLib 字段的映射只有一处实现："},"1371":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                          | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: Some(Topic::forum(n))` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":n}` |","table":"table-8"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                           | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: Some(Topic::thread(n))` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":n}` |","table":"table-8"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-142","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段              | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                         |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":…}` |","table":"table-8"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段       | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                      |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_markup` | `reply_markup` = `{\"@type\":\"replyMarkupInlineKeyboard\",\"rows\":…}` |","table":"table-8"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                    | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                               |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `link_preview: Some(false)` | `inputMessageText.link_preview_options.is_disabled = true` |","table":"table-8"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                 | 落到的 TDLib 字段                           |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `text` / `media.caption` | `formattedText`（经 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-8"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                    | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                            |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `is_chat_admin` 的 `user_id` | `getChatMember.member_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageSenderUser\",\"user_id\":…}` |","table":"table-8"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-147","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`（`send_message_then` / `send_message_album_then` /\n`edit_message_text_then` / `edit_message_caption_then` / `edit_message_media_then` /\n`edit_message_reply_markup_then` / `delete_message_then` / `answer_callback_query_then` /\n`forward_messages_then` / `react_then` / `unreact_then`）：\n把等待挪到另一个线程，**立刻返回**，结局交给闭包。"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-148","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"⚠️ 它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码。"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-149","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"方法成功时返回的就是 TDLib 原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>` / `()`），没有额外包装。\n带状态的返回类型只有 `EntitiesResolution` / `EntityResult` / `FileDownload` 三个（见第 9 节）。"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-150","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'SimplifyError::Abi': { description: 'ABI 层出错（宿主没接 TDLib、请求号无效等）。', type: 'AbiError' }, 'SimplifyE…\" />"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"编辑类**刻意不重试**——限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"封装层额外推的两条事件（不想用就订阅原始 `@type`，两者不冲突）："},"1384":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"| 事件                  | 谁发                    | 负载                              |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `entities_resolved` | `resolve_entities` 末尾 | `EntitiesResolution::to_json()` |","table":"table-9"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"| 事件              | 谁发                                 | 负载                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `file_progress` | `download_file` 每收到一条 `updateFile` | `{\"file_id\":…,\"completed\":…,\"downloaded_size\":…,\"expected_size\":…}` |","table":"table-9"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"便捷封装的方法名 / 字段路径是按真 `td_api.tl` 拼的，离线测试拿 `TdApiSchema::check_request`\n逐条校验过（详见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的第 10 节）；\nMarkdown → entities 的真库行为另有一条 `-- --ignored` 测试。但「真 Telegram 认不认这些值」\n要真账号才验得了。"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"page","content":"调用 TDLib","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"td_invoke、请求号与 response 通道、便捷封装"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号与 response 通道"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名以 TDLib 为准"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"便捷封装：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"等到什么才返回"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"回调里用 `*_then`"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"最小上手"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"两条时间线"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"Python / JS"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"插件不直接碰 `tdjson` 库，只把请求交给宿主："},"1398":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数   | 输入                       | 用途     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------ | ------ |\n| `td_invoke` | 完整请求 JSON（**含 `@type`**） | 手写整份请求 |","table":"table-0"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数              | 输入            | 用途                                                |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_invoke_simplified` | 方法名 + 参数 JSON | 宿主把参数补上 `@type = 方法名`（参数不是对象就整份换成 `{\"@type\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数    | 输入                   | 用途                                                                    |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute` | 完整请求 JSON，**同步**返回响应 | 只给「不碰服务器」的方法用（`parseTextEntities` / `getTextEntities` 之类）。当场有结果、不发请求号 |","table":"table-0"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"前两个返回**请求号**（`RequestId`），不是结果。结果从响应通道回来。"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号把去程与回程对上"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件调 td_invoke 拿到请求号，宿主注入字符串 @extra 后发给 TDLib；响应回来时接收循环按 @extra